    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.27
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u7F3A\u5C11 MOD \u7684\u5B58\u6863\u73B0\u5728\u4F1A\u6B63\u5E38\u5217\u51FA\uFF0C\u5E76\u663E\u793A\u7F3A\u5C11\u54EA\u4E9B
        MOD\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Saves with missing mods now list normally, showing which
        mods are missing."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.28
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u7269\u54C1\u63CF\u8FF0\u5DF2\u4FEE\u6B63\u8BED\u6CD5\u5E76\u63D0\u5347\u6E05\u6670\u5EA6\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Item descriptions have been corrected for grammar and clarity."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.29
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u6F14\u793A\u7248\u7684\u591A\u4EBA\u6E38\u620F\u754C\u9762\u73B0\u5728\u4F1A\u8BF4\u660E\u5982\u4F55\u521B\u5EFA\u548C\u52A0\u5165\u7B2C
        1 \u661F\u533A\u7684\u6E38\u620F\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Demo multiplayer screen now explains hosting and joining
        Sector 1 games."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.30
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u5F15\u529B\u52A0\u519C\u73B0\u5728\u4F1A\u5411\u6240\u6709\u88AB\u7275\u62C9\u7684\u76EE\u6807\u663E\u793A\u7CFB\u7EF3\uFF0C\u5E76\u968F\u8DDD\u79BB\u6DE1\u51FA\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Gravity Cannon now shows a tether to everything it pulls,
        fading with range."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
