    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.16
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u65B0\u589E\u8230\u961F\u4E3B\u9898\u66F2\u97F3\u9891\u8BBE\u7F6E\uFF0C\u8230\u961F\u5728\u573A\u65F6\u64AD\u653E\u4E3B\u9898\u66F2\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 New Fleet Theme audio setting plays main theme while the
        fleet is present."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.17
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u9ED8\u8BA4\u955C\u5934\u8DDD\u79BB\u73B0\u5728\u4F1A\u5728\u4EFB\u4F55\u5C4F\u5E55\u4E0A\u4FDD\u6301\u4E00\u81F4\u7684\u98DE\u8239\u663E\u793A\u5927\u5C0F\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Default camera distance now targets a consistent ship size
        on any screen."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.18
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u5B58\u50A8\u7BB1\u56FE\u6807\u73B0\u5728\u4F1A\u663E\u793A\u5728\u5DF2\u63ED\u793A\u7684\u906D\u9047\u6218\u4E0A\uFF0C\u65B9\u4FBF\u63D0\u524D\u89C4\u5212\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Cache icons now show on revealed encounters so you can plan
        ahead."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.19
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u5BFC\u822A\u9762\u677F\u73B0\u5728\u4F1A\u9884\u89C8\u906D\u9047\u6218\u4E2D\u5B58\u50A8\u7BB1\u5C06\u6389\u843D\u7684\u7269\u54C1\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Navigation panel now previews what an encounter's cache
        will drop."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.20
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u56FE\u9274\u7684\u7269\u54C1\u9875\u9762\u73B0\u5728\u4F1A\u5217\u51FA\u54EA\u4E2A\u6D3E\u7CFB\u6301\u6709\u8BE5\u7269\u54C1\u7684\u56FA\u5B9A\u5B58\u50A8\u7BB1\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Glossary item pages now list which faction holds a fixed
        cache for the item."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.21
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u8230\u8239\u7F16\u8F91\u5668\u7684\u98DE\u8239\u7C7B\u578B\u7EDF\u8BA1\u73B0\u5728\u4F1A\u663E\u793A\u65B0\u7684\u5A01\u80C1\u500D\u7387\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Class stats in the ship designer now show the new threat
        multipliers."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.22
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u98DE\u8239\u8BBE\u8BA1\u5668\u7684\u9884\u8BBE\u6587\u4EF6\u5939\u73B0\u5728\u4F1A\u6309\u4F60\u6240\u7528\u8BED\u8A00\u7684\u5B57\u6BCD\u987A\u5E8F\u6392\u5E8F\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship designer preset folders now sort alphabetically in
        your language."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.23
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.24
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>\u9519\u8BEF\u4FEE\u590D</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.25
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u4FEE\u590D\u4E86\u5FEB\u901F\u70B9\u6309\u5149\u675F\u6B66\u5668\u9020\u6210\u7684\u4F24\u5BB3\u8FDC\u9AD8\u4E8E\u6301\u7EED\u5F00\u706B\u7684\u95EE\u9898\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed rapidly tapping beam weapons dealing far more damage
        than holding fire."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.26
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u654C\u65B9\u5149\u675F\u3001\u706B\u70AC\u706B\u7130\u548C\u65CB\u8F6C\u5706\u76D8\u4E0D\u518D\u6E32\u67D3\u5728\u4F60\u7684\u98DE\u8239\u4E0B\u65B9\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Enemy beams, torch flames and spinner discs no longer render
        under your ship."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.27
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u5149\u73AF\u7684\u5149\u6655\u73B0\u5728\u4F1A\u5728\u98DE\u8239\u540E\u65B9\u53D1\u5149\uFF0C\u800C\u4E0D\u518D\u7ED8\u5236\u5728\u9644\u8FD1\u654C\u4EBA\u4E0A\u65B9\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Halo auras now glow behind ships instead of drawing over
        nearby enemies."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.28
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u98DE\u8239\u5728\u76F8\u4F4D\u79FB\u52A8\u9014\u4E2D\u88AB\u6467\u6BC1\u65F6\uFF0C\u5176\u62D6\u5C3E\u4E0D\u518D\u6C38\u4E45\u6B8B\u7559\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Phase Shift trails no longer linger forever when a ship
        dies mid-phase."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.29
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u5EF6\u8FDF\u5F00\u706B\u7684\u8B66\u793A\u73AF\u4E0D\u518D\u5728\u5C04\u51FB\u9014\u4E2D\u6539\u88C5\u540E\u6B8B\u7559\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Delayed-fire warning rings no longer stick around after
        a mid-shot refit."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.30
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u53CB\u65B9\u98DE\u8239\u8F6E\u5ED3\u73B0\u5728\u4EE5\u5168\u5206\u8FA8\u7387\u6E32\u67D3\uFF0C\u4FEE\u590D\u8FB9\u7F18\u50CF\u7D20\u5316\u7684\u95EE\u9898\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Friendly ship outlines now render at full resolution to
        fix pixelated edges."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.31
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u4FEE\u590D\u4E86\u53D1\u5C04\u9ED1\u6D1E\u7684\u98DE\u8239\u88AB\u6467\u6BC1\u540E\u9ED1\u6D1E\u624D\u5F62\u6210\u65F6\u51FA\u73B0\u7684\u9519\u8BEF\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error when a black hole formed after its firing
        ship was destroyed."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.32
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u4FEE\u590D\u4E86\u5728\u4E2D\u961F\u6216\u53CB\u65B9\u98DE\u8239\u9635\u4EA1\u77AC\u95F4\u4F7F\u7528\u80F6\u56CA\u65F6\u51FA\u73B0\u7684\u9519\u8BEF\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error using a capsule the moment a squadron or
        friendly ship died."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.33
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u4FEE\u590D\u4E86\u5C1A\u672A\u653E\u5165\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u7684\u661F\u533A\u94A5\u77F3\u663E\u793A\u6697\u8272\u8F6E\u5ED3\u7684\u95EE\u9898\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed dark outlines showing for Sector Keystones not yet
        placed in a gateway."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.34
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u8DC3\u8FC1\u8FDB\u573A\u7684\u98DE\u8239\u4E0D\u518D\u6709\u77ED\u6682\u7684\u6B66\u5668\u6307\u5411\u9519\u8BEF\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ships jumping in no longer point their weapons the wrong
        way for a second."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.35
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u5C06\u88C5\u5907\u62D6\u653E\u5230\u5546\u8230\u7684\u5E93\u5B58\u7269\u54C1\u4E0A\u4E0D\u518D\u5F15\u53D1\u9519\u8BEF\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Dropping equipment onto a trader's stock item no longer
        causes an error."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.36
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u98DE\u8239\u8DC3\u8FC1\u79BB\u573A\u540E\uFF0C\u72B6\u6001\u6548\u679C\u7684\u89C6\u89C9\u8868\u73B0\u4E0D\u518D\u53D8\u5F97\u5DE8\u5927\u6216\u88AB\u538B\u6241\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Status effect visuals no longer become giant or squashed
        after ships jump out."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.37
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u72B6\u6001\u6548\u679C\u4E0D\u518D\u6F02\u6D6E\u663E\u793A\u5728\u5904\u4E8E\u76F8\u4F4D\u6216\u9690\u85CF\u72B6\u6001\u7684\u98DE\u8239\u4E0A\u65B9\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Status effects no longer appear floating over a phased or
        hidden ship."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.38
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u707C\u70E7\u706B\u7130\u73B0\u5728\u4F1A\u81EA\u7136\u6D88\u9000\uFF0C\u800C\u4E0D\u518D\u88AB\u7A81\u7136\u622A\u65AD\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Burning flames now fade out naturally instead of being cut
        off abruptly."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.39
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u88AB\u6253\u6389\u7684\u90E8\u4EF6\u4E0D\u518D\u663E\u793A\u9519\u4E71\u4E14\u4E45\u4E45\u4E0D\u6D88\u7684\u51CF\u76CA\u8F6E\u5ED3\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Blown-off parts no longer show glitchy debuff outlines that
        outlive them."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.40
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u5947\u70B9\u5BC6\u94A5\u5EFA\u7B51\u548C\u5DF2\u89E3\u9501\u7684\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u4E0D\u518D\u4E22\u5931\u9634\u5F71\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Singularity Key structures and unlocked gateways no longer
        lose their shadow."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.41
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u706B\u7130\u3001\u51B0\u51BB\u548C\u7B49\u79BB\u5B50\u6B66\u5668\u7279\u6548\u4E0D\u518D\u892A\u6210\u6D51\u6D4A\u7684\u6697\u8272\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Flame, cryo and plasma weapon effects no longer fade to
        murky dark colors."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.42
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u5B8C\u6210\u5F53\u524D\u906D\u9047\u6218\u540E\uFF0C\u96F7\u8FBE\u661F\u56FE\u73B0\u5728\u4F1A\u663E\u793A\u968F\u4E4B\u63ED\u793A\u7684\u906D\u9047\u6218\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Radar map now shows encounters revealed when you complete
        your current one."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.43
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u53EC\u5524\u548C\u62A4\u822A\u98DE\u8239\u5728\u7F16\u961F\u98DE\u884C\u65F6\u73B0\u5728\u4F1A\u968F\u961F\u957F\u4E00\u540C\u7784\u51C6\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Summoned and escort ships now aim with their leader when
        flying in formation."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.44
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u4FEE\u590D\u4E86\u62A4\u536B\u8230\u5728\u661F\u4E91\u906D\u9047\u6218\u4E2D\u6392\u653E\u70DF\u96FE\u5F15\u53D1\u7684\u9519\u8BEF\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed errors from frigates venting smoke in nebula encounters."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.45
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u4FEE\u590D\u4E86\u8FDE\u7EED\u5173\u95ED\u591A\u6761\u9519\u8BEF\u63D0\u793A\u540E
        HUD \u4FDD\u6301\u9690\u85CF\u7684\u95EE\u9898\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed the HUD staying hidden after dismissing back-to-back
        error messages."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.46
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u653B\u51FB\u9014\u4E2D\u88AB\u6467\u6BC1\u7684\u98DE\u8239\u4E0D\u518D\u6253\u51FA\u6700\u540E\u4E00\u51FB\u6216\u5F15\u53D1\u9519\u8BEF\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ships destroyed mid-attack no longer fire a final shot or
        trigger an error."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.47
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u4FEE\u590D\u4E86\u53CD\u5C04\u4F24\u5BB3\u6467\u6BC1\u6B63\u5728\u53D1\u5C04\u5149\u675F\u6B66\u5668\u7684\u98DE\u8239\u65F6\u51FA\u73B0\u7684\u9519\u8BEF\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error when reflected damage destroyed a ship firing
        beam weapons."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.48
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u55B7\u706B\u5668\u7C7B\u6B66\u5668\u7684\u97F3\u8C03\u4F1A\u6709\u6240\u53D8\u5316\uFF0C\u53E0\u52A0\u591A\u628A\u65F6\u4E0D\u518D\u53D1\u51FA\u91D1\u5C5E\u58F0\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Flamethrower-style weapons vary sound pitch so stacked copies
        aren't metallic."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.49
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u6301\u7EED\u5F00\u706B\u7C7B\u6B66\u5668\u5728\u8FC7\u70ED\u671F\u95F4\u4F1A\u4FDD\u6301\u9759\u97F3\uFF0C\u56E0\u4E3A\u6B64\u65F6\u5E76\u672A\u5F00\u706B\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Constant-fire weapons now go silent while overheated since
        nothing is firing."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.50
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u901A\u5F80\u5DF2\u5B8C\u6210\u5934\u76EE\u906D\u9047\u6218\u7684\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u4E0D\u518D\u663E\u793A\u65E0\u5904\u53EF\u9003\u8B66\u544A\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Gateways to completed boss encounters no longer show the
        No Escape warning."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.51
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u4FEE\u590D\u4E86\u6E38\u620F\u5361\u987F\u65F6\u52A0\u8F7D\u754C\u9762\u7684\u98DE\u8239\u63A0\u5F71\u6D88\u5931\u7684\u95EE\u9898\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed the loading screen ship flyby vanishing when the game
        stutters."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.52
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 \u6D3E\u7CFB\u9886\u5730\u9AD8\u4EAE\u5728\u5207\u6362\u5730\u56FE\u89C6\u56FE\u65F6\u4E0D\u518D\u53D1\u751F\u504F\u79FB\u3002"
      baseValue: "\u2022 Faction territory highlights no longer drift out of place
        between map views."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.53
      type: 13
