      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.8.description
      type: 9
      value: "\u5C06\u4E8E\u661F\u533A 4 \u767B\u573A\uFF0C\u8FD9\u4E9B\u56FA\u5B9A\u5F0F\u6B66\u5668\u4EE5\u7075\u6D3B\u6027\u6362\u53D6\u7EAF\u7CB9\u7684\u706B\u529B\u3002\u53EF\u671F\u5F85\u5DE8\u578B\u7A7F\u900F\u6FC0\u5149\u548C\u8D85\u5927\u578B\u5C04\u5F39\u3002"
      baseValue: Arriving in Sector 4, these fixed weapons trade flexibility for
        raw power. Expect massive piercing lasers and oversized projectiles.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.9.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "\u661F\u533A 4 - \u7B2C\u4E00\u9636\u6BB5"
      baseValue: Sector 4 - Phase 1
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.9.description
      type: 9
      value: "\u8FD4\u56DE\u6545\u4E61\u661F\u533A 4\uFF0845 - 50 \u7EA7\uFF09\uFF0C\u5728
        Echo \u5B8C\u6210\u5979\u6B66\u5668\u7684\u7B2C\u4E00\u9636\u6BB5\u671F\u95F4\uFF0C\u62B5\u5FA1\u4E0D\u65AD\u5347\u7EA7\u7684
        Species-XI \u548C Skeran \u5165\u4FB5\uFF0C\u4FDD\u536B\u5730\u7403\u3002"
      baseValue: Return home to Sector 4 (Level 45 - 50) and defend Earth against
        escalating Species-XI and Skeran incursions while Echo completes the first
        stage of her weapon.
