  - categoryName: Scene.Game.Demo End Canvas
    entries:
    - key: kavk7l86
      type: 9
      value: "\u6F14\u793A\u5B8C\u6210"
      baseValue: Demo Complete
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Sp3qc7xG
      type: 8
      value: "\u606D\u559C\uFF0C\u60A8\u5DF2\u5B8C\u6210\u6F14\u793A\u7248\uFF01\n\n<color=#89bcde>\u5B8C\u6574\u7248\u73B0\u5DF2\u5F00\u653E\u62A2\u5148\u4F53\u9A8C\uFF01\u65E0\u8BBA\u60A8\u662F\u5426\u8D2D\u4E70\uFF0C\u6211\u90FD\u671F\u5F85\u5728
        Discord \u4E0A\u542C\u5230\u60A8\u5BF9\u6F14\u793A\u7248\u7684\u770B\u6CD5\u3002</color>\n\n<color=#5776a0>\u73A9\u5BB6\u5B58\u6863\u5C06\u8F6C\u79FB\u81F3\u5B8C\u6574\u7248\uFF0C\u60A8\u7684\u5192\u9669\u53EF\u4EE5\u7EE7\u7EED\u3002</color>"
      baseValue: 'Congrats, you have completed the demo!


        <color=#89bcde>The
        full game is now out in Early Access! Whether you grab it or not, I''d love
        to hear what you thought of the demo in our Discord.</color>


        <color=#5776a0>Player
        saves will transfer to the full game so your adventure can continue.</color>'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 5dynyIZW
      type: 9
      value: "\u67E5\u770B\u5546\u5E97\u9875\u9762"
      baseValue: View Store Page
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
  - categoryName: Scene.Game.Early Access End Canvas
    entries:
    - key: sd1yGGyy
      type: 9
      value: "\u62A2\u5148\u4F53\u9A8C\uFF1A\u6545\u4E8B\u8FDB\u884C\u4E2D"
      baseValue: 'Early Access: Story In Progress'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: M2TRKJpM
      type: 8
      value: "\u5267\u60C5\u8FDB\u5EA6\u6682\u505C\u2026\u2026\u81F3\u5C11\u76EE\u524D\u5982\u6B64\u3002\n\n\u4F60\u5DF2\u62B5\u8FBE\u62A2\u5148\u4F53\u9A8C\u4E2D\u73B0\u6709\u5267\u60C5\u5185\u5BB9\u7684\u4E0A\u9650\u3002\u66F4\u591A\u5267\u60C5\u4E0E\u7CFB\u7EDF\u6B63\u5728\u5F00\u53D1\u4E2D\u3002\n\n\u4F60\u53EF\u4EE5\u7EE7\u7EED\u5728<color=#FB6330>\u65B0\u6E38\u620F+</color>\u4E2D\u6E38\u73A9\uFF0C\u91CD\u7F6E\u4EFB\u52A1\u5E76\u4EE5\u66F4\u9AD8\u7B49\u7EA7\u8FD4\u56DE\u7B2C
        1 \u661F\u533A\uFF0C\u540C\u65F6\u4FDD\u7559\u4F60\u7684\u98DE\u8239\u3001\u5347\u7EA7\u4E0E\u7269\u54C1\u3002"
      baseValue: 'Story progression paused... for now.


        You''ve reached
        the current limit of story content in Early Access. More story and systems
        are in development.


        You can continue playing in <color=#FB6330>New
        Game+</color>, resetting missions and returning to Sector 1 at a higher level
        while keeping your ship, upgrades, and items.'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: WBmB4joN
      type: 8
      value: "\u65B0\u6E38\u620F+\u4E3A\u53EF\u9009\u5185\u5BB9\u3002\u4E00\u65E6\u5F00\u59CB\uFF0C\u6B64\u9009\u62E9\u5C06\u6C38\u4E45\u751F\u6548\uFF0C\u4F60\u5C06\u65E0\u6CD5\u8FD4\u56DE\u5F53\u524D\u7B49\u7EA7\u3002"
      baseValue: New Game+ is optional. Once started, this choice is permanent and
        you cannot return to this level.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vRuztZBk
      type: 9
      value: "\u5F00\u59CB\u65B0\u6E38\u620F+"
      baseValue: Start New Game+
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
