  - categoryName: Scene.Game.HUD Tutorial Helper
    entries:
    - key: OG7Lffb1
      type: 18
      value: "\u60A8\u53EF\u4EE5\u4F7F\u7528\u7275\u5F15\u5149\u675F\u6765\u6536\u96C6\u9644\u8FD1\u7684\u7269\u54C1\u5BB9\u5668\u3002"
      baseValue: You can use your tractor beam to pull in nearby item containers.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: D4tpv9Eg
      type: 18
      value: "\u60A8\u53EF\u4EE5\u4F7F\u7528\u4EE5\u4E0B\u63A7\u5236\u6309\u952E\u6765\u8F6C\u52A8\u3001\u52A0\u901F\u548C\u7A33\u5B9A\u60A8\u7684\u98DE\u8239\u3002"
      baseValue: You can turn, accelerate and stabilize your ship using the controls
        below.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: GgnYo5Si
      type: 18
      value: "\u6309\u4F4F\u95EA\u907F\u952E\u5E76\u6309\u4EFB\u610F\u65B9\u5411\u952E\u6765\u8EB2\u907F\u654C\u4EBA\u3002"
      baseValue: Hold the dodge key and press any direction to dodge and avoid enemies.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8ksGCocz
      type: 18
      value: "\u6309\u4F4F\u95EA\u907F\u4FEE\u6B63\uFF0C\u5E76\u671D\u8BE5\u65B9\u5411\u79FB\u52A8\u4EE5\u8EB2\u907F\u3002"
      baseValue: Hold down the dodge modifier and move in a direction to dodge that
        way.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 40aaJoXo
      type: 18
      value: "\u5982\u679C\u60A8\u9700\u8981\u5FEB\u901F\u5230\u8FBE\u67D0\u4E2A\u5730\u65B9\uFF0C\u8BF7\u4F7F\u7528\u52A9\u63A8\u6309\u94AE\u3002"
      baseValue: Use the boost button if you need to get somewhere quickly.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: A3xhd830
      type: 18
      value: "\u4E3B\u6B66\u5668\u5728\u4F7F\u7528\u65F6\u4F1A\u4EA7\u751F\u70ED\u91CF\uFF0C\u8FC7\u70ED\u4F1A\u5BFC\u81F4\u5176\u5931\u6548\u3002"
      baseValue: Primary weapons generate heat when used, overheating will disable
        them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8yy9WQ8e
      type: 18
      value: "\u5207\u6362\u70AE\u5854\u6A21\u5F0F\u53EF\u8BA9\u4F60\u98DE\u8239\u4E0A\u7684\u6B66\u5668\u72EC\u7ACB\u7784\u51C6\u3002"
      baseValue: Toggle turret mode to aim your weapons independently from your ship.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qjFmgpCP
      type: 18
      value: "\u60A8\u53EF\u4EE5\u4F7F\u7528\u4E0B\u9762\u7684\u63A7\u5236\u6309\u952E\u8BA9\u98DE\u8239\u5355\u72EC\u7784\u51C6\u3002"
      baseValue: You can aim separately from your ship using the controls below.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: YOcC3mqm
      type: 18
      value: "\u6838\u5FC3\u9762\u677F\u5305\u542B\u5347\u7EA7\u3001\u88C5\u5907\u3001\u4EFB\u52A1\u548C\u5BFC\u822A\u3002"
      baseValue: The core panel contains upgrades, equipment, missions and navigation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: D8bNqsfe
      type: 18
      value: "\u5C04\u51FB\u9644\u8FD1\u7684\u4E00\u9897\u5C0F\u884C\u661F\u8FDB\u884C\u7EC3\u4E60\u3002"
      baseValue: Shoot one of the nearby asteroids for target practice.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: mtEKYWW3
      type: 18
      value: "\u4F60\u5DF2\u5B8C\u6210\u4E00\u9879\u4EFB\u52A1\u3002\u5B83\u53EF\u4ECE<color=#ffc600>\u4EFB\u52A1\u9762\u677F</color>\u6536\u96C6\u3002"
      baseValue: You have completed a mission. It can be collected from the <color=#ffc600>Mission
        Panel</color>.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: jXjkzH27
      type: 18
      value: "\u79FB\u5411\u6BCD\u8230\u5E76\u6309\u4E0B<color=#ffc600>\u4EA4\u4E92</color>\u5BF9\u63A5\u3002"
      baseValue: Move toward the mothership and press <color=#ffc600>interact</color>
        to dock.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: sfgfxbnx
      type: 18
      value: "\u60A8\u53EF\u4EE5\u5728\u906D\u9047\u6218\u4E4B\u95F4\u8FDB\u884C\u8D85\u5149\u901F\u8DC3\u8FC1\uFF0C\u4EE5\u5B9E\u73B0\u66F4\u5FEB\u7684\u65C5\u884C\u3002"
      baseValue: You can hyperdrive jump between encounters for faster travel.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Xg6o3rEX
      type: 18
      value: "\u653E\u7F6E<color=#ffc600>\u661F\u533A\u94A5\u77F3</color>\u8FDB\u5165\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9<color=#ffc600>\u8BFA\u7EF4\u65AF\u666E\u83B1\u59C6Novus
        Prime </color> \u3002"
      baseValue: Place the <color=#ffc600>Sector Keystone</color> into the Secor
        Gateway at <color=#ffc600>Novus Prime</color>.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xwPjwzi8
      type: 18
      value: "<color=#ffc600>\u62A4\u76FE\u6297\u6027</color>\u4F1A\u8BA9\u4F60\u514D\u75AB\u8BE5\u7C7B\u578B\u7684\u51CF\u76CA\u6548\u679C\u3002"
      baseValue: <color=#ffc600>Shield Resistance</color> will make you immune to
        debuffs of that type.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: r6IBC7w9
      type: 18
      value: "\u60A8\u73B0\u5728\u53EF\u4EE5\u89E3\u9501\u53E6\u4E00\u4E2A\u69FD\u4F4D<color=#ffc600>\u5347\u7EA7</color>\u9762\u677F\u3002"
      baseValue: You can now unlock an additional slot in the <color=#ffc600>Upgrades</color>
        panel.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hPHo23Bg
      type: 18
      value: "\u5728<color=#ffc600>\u6BCD\u8230</color>\u7684<color=#ffc600>\u98DE\u8239\u8BBE\u8BA1</color>\u4E2D\u53EF\u9009\u62E9\u5176\u4ED6\u98DE\u8239\u7C7B\u578B\u3002"
      baseValue: Additional ship classes are available in <color=#ffc600>Ship Design</color>
        at the <color=#ffc600>Mothership</color>.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ArqiBaTi
      type: 18
      value: "\u60A8\u53EF\u4EE5\u94FE\u63A5<color=#DB5656>\u526F\u6B66\u5668</color>\u548C<color=#7756DB>\u7279\u6B8A\u6B66\u5668</color>\u88C5\u5907\u9762\u677F\u4E2D\u7684\u69FD\u4F4D\u3002"
      baseValue: You can link <color=#DB5656>Secondary Weapon</color> and <color=#7756DB>Special</color>
        slots in the equipment panel.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hmkSTF8r
      type: 18
      value: "\u9AD8\u901F\u4E0B\u52A9\u63A8\u589E\u901F\u4F1A\u8BA9\u4F60<color=#DA5F00>\u65E0\u61C8\u53EF\u51FB</color>\u5E76\u4F7F\u6B66\u5668\u5931\u6548\u3002"
      baseValue: Boosting at high speed makes you <color=#DA5F00>invulnerable</color>
        and disables weapons.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vAJLXeSx
      type: 18
      value: "\u6253\u5F00<color=#ffc600>\u5BFC\u822A\u9762\u677F</color>\u5728\u661F\u533A\u5730\u56FE\u4E0A\u5B9A\u4F4D\u96C6\u7ED3\u53F7\u3002"
      baseValue: Open the <color=#ffc600>Navigation Panel</color> to locate the Assembler
        on the sector map.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Yl7Tc7Bv
      type: 18
      value: "\u822A\u70B9\u662F<color=#ffc600>\u6C38\u4E45\u89E3\u9501</color>\u7684\uFF0C\u5373\u4F7F\u661F\u533A\u91CD\u65B0\u751F\u6210\u540E\uFF0C\u4ECD\u7136\u53EF\u4EE5\u8DF3\u8F6C\u5230\u8BE5\u822A\u70B9\u3002"
      baseValue: Waypoints are <color=#ffc600>permanent unlocks</color> and can still
        be jumped to after the sector is regenerated.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: FFlVzdh8
      type: 18
      value: "\u5982\u679C\u4F60\u60F3\u4E0E\u66F4\u591A Species-XI \u654C\u4EBA\u4EA4\u6218\uFF0C\u8BF7\u5BF9<color=#ffc600>\u822A\u70B9</color>\u4F7F\u7528<color=#ff441b>\u611F\u67D3\u79CD\u5B50</color>\u3002"
      baseValue: Use the <color=#ff441b>Infected Seed</color> on a <color=#ffc600>Waypoint</color>
        if you want to fight more Species-XI enemies.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
