    entries:
    - key: rYaZS5Ys.name
      type: 5
      value: "\u963F\u5C14\u6CD5.\u8428\u514B"
      baseValue: Alpha Saxa
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.name
      type: 5
      value: "\u963F\u65AF\u7279\u5229\u65AF"
      baseValue: Astralis
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u7EC8\u4E8E\u8BA9\u6211\u770B\u5230\u4E00\u5F20\u53CB\u597D\u7684\u9762\u5B54\u4E86\uFF01\u8001\u5409\u5FB7\u5728\u54EA\u513F\uFF1F"
      baseValue: About time I saw a friendly face! Where's ol' Gid?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u8BFA\u7EF4\u65AF\u666E\u83B1\u59C6Novus Prime \u2026\u2026\u6211\u4F1A\u628A\u5750\u6807\u53D1\u7ED9\u4F60\u3002"
      baseValue: Novus Prime... I'll send you the coordinates.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u8D85\u7A7A\u95F4\u5F15\u64CE\u53C8\u5728\u95F9\u813E\u6C14\u4E86\u2026\u2026\u8FD9\u8BE5\u6B7B\u7684\u4E1C\u897F\u6709\u70B9\u4E0D\u592A\u542C\u8BDD\u3002\u6211\u9700\u8981\u4E00\u70B9\u65F6\u95F4\u3002\u522B\u8BA9\u90A3\u4E9B\u654C\u4EBA\u9760\u8FD1\u6211\uFF0C\u597D\u5417\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Hyperdrive's actin' up... bloody thing's got a mind of its own.
        I'll need a wee bit o' time. Keep those hostiles off me, will ya?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.name
      type: 5
      value: "\u963F\u74E6\u9686Avalon"
      baseValue: Avalon
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u7684\u5165\u4FB5\u5230\u6B64\u7ED3\u675F\u3002\u4F60\u6839\u672C\u4E0D\u662F\u6211\u4EEC\u7684\u5BF9\u624B\uFF01"
      baseValue: Your incursion ends here. You are hopelessly outmatched!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u5BF9\u6B64\u4E0D\u592A\u786E\u5B9A\u3002"
      baseValue: I wouldn't be so sure about that.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u6240\u6709\u98DE\u8239\uFF0C\u96C6\u4E2D\u706B\u529B\u653B\u51FB\u57CE\u5821\u3002\u4E00\u5207\u5C31\u6B64\u7ED3\u675F\uFF01"
      baseValue: All ships, focus fire on the Citadel. This ends here!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.fleeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u8239\u4F53\u5FEB\u6491\u4E0D\u4F4F\u4E86\u3002\u6211\u6B63\u5728\u758F\u6563\u8239\u5458\u2026\u2026\u63A5\u4E0B\u6765\u5C31\u770B\u4F60\u7684\u4E86\u3002"
      baseValue: Hull's about to give. I'm getting the crew clear... it's on you
        now.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.completeDialog.0
      type: 2
