      value: "\u5341\u4E00\u79CD\u65CF\u5DF2\u62B5\u8FBE\u8BE5\u661F\u533A\u3002"
      baseValue: Species-XI have arrived in the sector.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u8BE5\u6B7B\u3002\u5982\u679C\u4ED6\u4EEC\u653B\u51FB\u8FD9\u4E48\u8FDC\u7684\u5730\u65B9\uFF0C\u90A3\u5C31\u610F\u5473\u7740\u5730\u7403\u5DF2\u7ECF\u5904\u4E8E\u5371\u9669\u4E4B\u4E2D\u3002\u6211\u4EEC\u9700\u8981\u56DE\u53BB\u8B66\u544A\u4ED6\u4EEC\u3002"
      baseValue: Damn. If they're attacking this far out, it means Earth is already
        at risk. We need to get back and warn them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u627E\u5230\u4E86\u4E00\u9897\u88AB\u611F\u67D3\u7684\u79CD\u5B50\u3002\u62FF\u53BB\u5427\uFF0C\u4F60\u4E5F\u8BB8\u80FD\u4ECE\u4E2D\u5B66\u5230\u4E00\u4E9B\u4E1C\u897F\u3002"
      baseValue: We recovered one of their infected seeds. Take it, you might be
        able to learn something from it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u60A8\u643A\u5E26\u7684\u611F\u67D3\u79CD\u5B50\u53EF\u7528\u4E8E\u611F\u67D3\u822A\u70B9\u3002"
      baseValue: The infected seed you carry can be used to infect a waypoint.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u8FD9\u542C\u8D77\u6765\u662F\u4E2A\u7CDF\u7CD5\u7684\u4E3B\u610F..."
      baseValue: That sounds like a terrible idea...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u662F\u7684\uFF0C\u5B83\u4F1A\u53EC\u5524\u66F4\u591A\u654C\u4EBA\u3002\u4F46\u53EA\u6709\u76F4\u9762\u5B83\u4EEC\uFF0C\u4F60\u624D\u80FD\u5B66\u4F1A\u5982\u4F55\u6253\u8D25\u5B83\u4EEC\u3002"
      baseValue: It would summon more of them, yes. But only by facing them will
        you learn to defeat them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xnoUDvXJ.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u4E00\u4E2A\u574F\u4E3B\u610F"
      baseValue: A Bad Idea
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xnoUDvXJ.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u827E\u514B\u8BA4\u4E3A\u60A8\u53EF\u4EE5\u4F7F\u7528\u611F\u67D3\u79CD\u5B50\u6765\u611F\u67D3\u822A\u70B9\u7ED3\u6784\u3002\u60A8\u4F1A\u5728\u65C5\u9014\u4E2D\u627E\u5230\u5B83\u4EEC\u3002"
      baseValue: Echo thinks you could use the Infected Seed to infect a waypoint
        structure. You'll find them on your journey.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xnoUDvXJ.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u8FD9\u662F\u4E00\u4E2A\u5927\u80C6\u7684\u4E3E\u52A8\u2026\u2026\u5982\u679C\u51FA\u4E86\u95EE\u9898\uFF0C\u5E1D\u7687\u4F1A\u60F3\u8981\u7B54\u6848\u3002"
      baseValue: A bold move... The Emperor will want answers if this goes wrong.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xnoUDvXJ.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u8BF4\u6E05\u695A\u4E86\uFF0C\u8FD9\u5B8C\u5168\u662F\u4F60\u7684\u60F3\u6CD5\u3002"
      baseValue: Just so we're clear, this was entirely your idea.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u6FC0\u6D3B\u7AD9\u70B9"
      baseValue: Activate Gateway
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u6FC0\u6D3B \u8BFA\u7EF4\u65AF\u666E\u83B1\u59C6Novus Prime  \u7684\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u3002"
      baseValue: Activate the Sector Gateway at Novus Prime.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u592A\u597D\u4E86\uFF0C\u60A8\u53EF\u4EE5\u5728 \u8BFA\u7EF4\u65AF\u666E\u83B1\u59C6Novus
        Prime  \u7684\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u4E2D\u4F7F\u7528\u8BE5\u94A5\u77F3\u3002"
      baseValue: Excellent, you can use that keystone in the sector gateway at Novus
        Prime.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u5DF2\u6FC0\u6D3B\u3002"
      baseValue: Sector gateway activated.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u5DF2\u542F\u7528\u3002\u518D\u6B21\u523A\u7A7F\u865A\u7A7A\u2026\u2026\u8FD9\u9879\u6280\u672F\u6BD4\u73B0\u5728\u7684\u5927\u591A\u6570\u4EBA\u90FD\u53E4\u8001\uFF0C\u5176\u79D8\u5BC6\u5DF2\u968F\u7740\u65F6\u95F4\u800C\u6D88\u5931\u3002"
      baseValue: The sector gateway is active. Once more piercing the void... technology
        older than most who now live, its secrets lost to time.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u865A\u7A7A\uFF1F\u8FD9\u5C31\u662F\u5341\u4E00\u79CD\u65CF\u7684\u7531\u6765\u2026\u2026"
      baseValue: The void? That's where Species-XI came from...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u5F88\u591A\u4E1C\u897F\u4ECE\u8FD9\u91CC\u8BDE\u751F\uFF0C\u4E5F\u6709\u5F88\u591A\u4E1C\u897F\u6D88\u5931\u3002\u7AD9\u70B9\u4F1A\u4FDD\u62A4\u4F60\u2026\u2026\u5B83\u7684\u5149\u8292\u95EA\u8000\u3002"
      baseValue: Where many things came from, and where many are lost. The gateways
        will shield you... its light burns bright.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u90A3\u2026\u2026\u751A\u81F3\u6CA1\u6709\u51FA\u73B0\u5728\u6211\u4EEC\u7684\u4F20\u611F\u5668\u4E0A\u3002"
      baseValue: That... didn't even show up on our sensors.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u5979\u597D\u50CF\u548C\u6211\u4EEC\u7684\u73B0\u5B9E\u683C\u683C\u4E0D\u5165\u3002\u5979\u80AF\u5B9A\u6765\u81EA\u865A\u7A7A\u3002"
      baseValue: It's like she's out of phase with our reality. She must be from
        the void.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u76EE\u524D\u6211\u4EEC\u7684\u76EE\u6807\u4E00\u81F4\u3002\u6211\u4EEC\u7684\u4F53\u578B\u592A\u5927\uFF0C\u65E0\u6CD5\u901A\u8FC7\uFF0C\u4F46\u5982\u679C\u4F60\u7EE7\u7EED\u524D\u8FDB\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u5C06\u4F7F\u7528\u4F60\u7684\u4FE1\u53F7\u6765\u5B9A\u4F4D\u4F60\u7684\u4F4D\u7F6E\u5E76\u8DDF\u8E2A\u4F60\u3002"
      baseValue: For now our objectives align. We're too large to fit through, but
        if you proceed, we'll use your signal to triangulate your position and follow.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.3.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u597D\u6D88\u606F\u662F\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u5DF2\u7ECF\u5BF9\u65AF\u514B\u5170\u98DE\u8239\u8FDB\u884C\u4E86\u9006\u5411\u5DE5\u7A0B\u3002\u73B0\u5728\u60A8\u53EF\u4EE5\u5C06\u5176\u90E8\u4EF6\u96C6\u6210\u5230\u60A8\u7684\u8BBE\u8BA1\u4E2D\u3002"
      baseValue: Some good news, we have reverse-engineered the Skeran ships. You
        can now integrate their parts into your design.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2fY7bTi9.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u86C7\u602A"
      baseValue: Basilisk
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2fY7bTi9.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u627E\u5230\u5E76\u6D88\u706D\u86C7\u602A\u3002"
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Basilisk.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2fY7bTi9.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u627E\u5230\u4E86\u7B2C\u4E8C\u5757\u94A5\u77F3\u3002\u5B83\u88AB\u65AF\u514B\u5170\u86C7\u602A\u6301\u6709\u3002"
      baseValue: We've located the second keystone. It's held by the Skeran Basilisk.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2fY7bTi9.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u8BE5\u4F4D\u7F6E\u5DF2\u5728\u60A8\u7684\u5BFC\u822A\u9762\u677F\u4E0A\u6807\u8BB0\u3002\u8BF7\u5C0F\u5FC3\u63A5\u8FD1\u5E76\u786E\u4FDD\u60A8\u5DF2\u505A\u597D\u51C6\u5907\u3002"
      baseValue: The location has been marked on your navigation panel. Approach
        carefully and ensure you're prepared.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8rT7W5Mz.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u5DE8\u517D"
      baseValue: Behemoth
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8rT7W5Mz.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u627E\u5230\u5E76\u6467\u6BC1\u5DE8\u517D\u3002"
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Behemoth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8rT7W5Mz.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u5DF2\u7ECF\u627E\u5230\u4E86\u5176\u4E2D\u4E00\u5757\u94A5\u77F3\uFF0C\u5E76\u5728\u60A8\u7684\u5BFC\u822A\u9762\u677F\u4E0A\u6807\u8BB0\u4E86\u5B83\u7684\u4F4D\u7F6E\u3002\u8BF7\u5C06\u5176\u53D6\u56DE\u5E76\u5E26\u56DE\u8FD9\u91CC\u3002"
      baseValue: We've tracked down one of the keystones and marked its location
        in your navigation panel. Retrieve it and bring it back here.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7ZURVAI0.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u5783\u573E\u5904\u7406"
      baseValue: Junk Disposal
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7ZURVAI0.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u6467\u6BC1\u6E23\u6ED3\u4F7F\u7528\u7684\u7CBE\u82F1\u516C\u725B\u53F7\u98DE\u8239\u3002"
      baseValue: Destroy the elite Bull ship used by the Junkers.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7ZURVAI0.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u8FDB\u5165\u4E86\u6E23\u6ED3\u7A7A\u95F4\u3002\u8FD9\u91CC\u6709\u9003\u5175\u3001\u6D77\u76D7\uFF0C\u751A\u81F3\u8FD8\u6709\u66F4\u7CDF\u7CD5\u7684\u3002"
      baseValue: You've entered Junker space. Deserters, pirates, and worse.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7ZURVAI0.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u4ED6\u4EEC\u7684\u65D7\u8230\u5C31\u5728\u9644\u8FD1\u3002\u6467\u6BC1\u5B83\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u5C31\u80FD\u6253\u7834\u6E23\u6ED3\u5BF9\u8FD9\u6761\u5C0F\u884C\u661F\u5E26\u7684\u63A7\u5236\u3002\u7531\u4F60\u51B3\u5B9A\u2026\u2026\u4E0D\u8FC7\u6E23\u6ED3\u53EF\u4E0D\u597D\u5BF9\u4ED8\u3002"
      baseValue: Their flagship is close. Destroy it, and we break their hold on
        this belt. Your call... but Junkers don't go down easy.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xytKXsHs.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u57CE\u5821"
      baseValue: Citadel
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xytKXsHs.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u6467\u6BC1\u57CE\u5821\u7684\u65F6\u5019\u5230\u4E86\u3002"
      baseValue: Time has come to destroy the Citadel.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xytKXsHs.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u5DF2\u786E\u5B9A\u4E86\u6700\u540E\u4E00\u5757\u94A5\u77F3\u7684\u6240\u5728\u4F4D\u7F6E\u3002\u5B83\u5C31\u4FDD\u5B58\u5728\u65AF\u514B\u5170\u57CE\u5821\u4E2D\uFF01"
      baseValue: We've pinpointed the location of the final keystone. It's kept in
        the Skeran Citadel!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xytKXsHs.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u57CE\u5821\u6212\u5907\u68EE\u4E25\u3002\u5B83\u662F\u65AF\u514B\u5170\u5728\u8FD9\u4E00\u5730\u533A\u7684\u884C\u52A8\u4E2D\u5FC3\uFF0C\u56E0\u6B64\u9884\u8BA1\u4F1A\u906D\u9047\u5F3A\u70C8\u62B5\u6297\u3002"
      baseValue: The Citadel is heavily fortified. It's the heart of Skeran operations
        in this region, so expect heavy resistance.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xytKXsHs.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u5DF2\u7ECF\u5728\u4F60\u7684\u5BFC\u822A\u9762\u677F\u4E0A\u505A\u4E86\u6807\u8BB0\u3002\u8FD9\u662F\u5B8C\u5168\u6FC0\u6D3B\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u7684\u6700\u540E\u4E00\u6B65\uFF0C\u8BF7\u786E\u4FDD\u4F60\u5DF2\u505A\u597D\u51C6\u5907\u3002"
      baseValue: I've marked it on your navigation panel. This is the last step to
        fully activate the sector gateway, make sure you're prepared.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PJaRqnUm.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u9A71\u9010"
      baseValue: Cast Out
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PJaRqnUm.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u627E\u5230\u5E76\u6467\u6BC1\u653E\u9010\u8005\u4F7F\u7528\u7684\u7CBE\u82F1\u72EE\u9E6B\u3002"
      baseValue: Locate and destroy the Elite Griffin used by the Outcasts.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PJaRqnUm.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u6B63\u5728\u8FDB\u5165\u653E\u9010\u8005\u9886\u5730\u3002\u4ED6\u4EEC\u6EE5\u7528\u65F6\u95F4\u9A71\u52A8\uFF0C\u5BFC\u81F4\u6DF1\u53D7\u5176\u5BB3\u3002\u5C0F\u5FC3\u884C\u4E8B\u3002"
      baseValue: You're entering Outcast territory. Their abuse of Temporal Drives
        has broken them. Tread carefully.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PJaRqnUm.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u4ED6\u4EEC\u7684\u65D7\u8230\u5DF2\u7ECF\u8FD1\u5728\u54AB\u5C3A\u3002\u5982\u679C\u51FB\u843D\u5B83\uFF0C\u4ED6\u4EEC\u5BF9\u6B64\u5730\u7684\u63A7\u5236\u5C31\u53EF\u80FD\u52A8\u6447\u3002"
      baseValue: Their flagship is close. Take it down, and their grip here may falter.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u5230\u8FBE \u8BFA\u7EF4\u65AF\u666E\u83B1\u59C6Novus Prime"
      baseValue: Reach Novus Prime
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u62A4\u9001\u8230\u961F\u524D\u5F80\u8BFA\u7EF4\u65AF\u666E\u83B1\u59C6Novus
        Prime \u3002"
      baseValue: Escort the fleet to Novus Prime.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u5E72\u5F97\u597D\u3002\u592A\u63A5\u8FD1\u4E86\u2026\u2026\u592A\u8FC7\u63A5\u8FD1\u4E86\u3002\u6211\u6000\u7591\u5176\u4ED6\u4EBA\u80FD\u4E0D\u80FD\u5E2E\u6211\u4EEC\u6446\u8131\u56F0\u5883\u3002"
      baseValue: Excellent work. That was close... too close. I doubt anyone else
        could've got us out of that.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u9700\u8981\u7ACB\u5373\u8FD4\u56DE\u5730\u7403\uFF0C\u5E76\u8B66\u544A\u5E1D\u7687\u8FD9\u4E2A\u65B0\u654C\u4EBA\u7684\u5B58\u5728\u3002"
      baseValue: We need to return to Earth immediately and warn the Emperor about
        this new enemy.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u5947\u602A\u3002\u8D85\u7A7A\u95F4\u5F15\u64CE\u7CFB\u7EDF\u53EF\u4EE5\u8FD0\u884C\uFF0C\u4F46\u662F\u2026\u2026\u6211\u4EEC\u65E0\u6CD5\u89C4\u5212\u76F4\u63A5\u8FD4\u56DE\u5730\u7403\u7684\u8DEF\u7EBF\u3002"
      baseValue: Strange. Hyperdrive systems are operational, but... we can't plot
        a direct course back to Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u5565\uFF1F\u4E3A\u4EC0\u4E48\u4E0D\u53EF\u4EE5\uFF1F"
      baseValue: What? Why not?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.4
      type: 2
      value: "\u672A\u77E5\u3002\u5BFC\u822A\u6570\u636E\u4F3C\u4E4E\u2026\u2026\u5DF2\u635F\u574F\u3002"
      baseValue: Unknown. Navigation data appears... corrupted.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.5
      type: 2
      value: "\u95EE\u9898\u5F88\u4E25\u91CD\u3002\u662F\u654C\u4EBA\u5BFC\u81F4\u7684\u5417\uFF1F"
      baseValue: That's a serious problem. Could the enemy be responsible?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.6
      type: 2
      value: "\u654C\u4EBA\u88AB\u79F0\u4E3A\u5341\u4E00\u79CD\u65CF\u3002"
      baseValue: The enemy are called Species-XI.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.7
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u600E\u4E48\u77E5\u9053\u7684\uFF1F"
      baseValue: How do you know that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.8
      type: 2
      value: "\u4E00\u4E2A\u5947\u602A\u7684\u767D\u8272\u53D1\u5149\u7269\u4F53\u544A\u8BC9\u6211\u4EEC......"
      baseValue: A strange glowing white entity told us...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.9
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u660E\u767D\u4E86...\u8FD9\u5E76\u4E0D\u4EE4\u4EBA\u653E\u5FC3\u3002"
      baseValue: I see... That's not exactly reassuring.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.10
      type: 2
      value: "\u5979\u8FD8\u8BF4\u5979\u628A\u8FD9\u8258\u8239\u7559\u7ED9\u4E86\u6211\u4EEC\u3002"
      baseValue: She also said she left this ship for us.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.11
      type: 2
      value: "\u4E86\u89E3\u4E86\u3002\u73B0\u5728\uFF0C\u8BF7\u524D\u5F80\u8BFA\u7EF4\u65AF\u666E\u83B1\u59C6Novus
        Prime \u7684\u661F\u533A\u4F20\u9001\u95E8\u3002\u6211\u4EEC\u5230\u90A3\u91CC\u518D\u8BE6\u8C08\u3002"
      baseValue: Noted. For now, head toward the sector gateway at Novus Prime. We'll
        talk more there.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.12
      type: 2
      value: "\u5728\u6211\u4EEC\u79BB\u5F00\u4E4B\u524D\uFF0C\u4F60\u9700\u8981\u9886\u53D6\u4EFB\u52A1\u5956\u52B1\u3002\u6BD5\u7ADF\uFF0C\u8FD9\u662F\u5F53\u52A1\u4E4B\u6025\u3002"
      baseValue: Before we leave, you have a mission reward to collect. Priorities,
        after all.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u597D\u5427\uFF0C\u5728\u51FA\u73B0\u66F4\u591A\u5947\u602A\u7684\u751F\u7269\u4E4B\u524D\u6211\u4EEC\u8D76\u7D27\u79BB\u5F00\u8FD9\u91CC\u5427\u3002"
      baseValue: All right, let's get out of here before more strange creatures appear.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u54E6\uFF0C\u770B\u90A3\uFF0C\u4E00\u4E9B\u53CB\u597D\u7684\u5F53\u5730\u4EBA\uFF01"
      baseValue: Oh, look at that, some friendly locals!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u4EA4\u51FA\u4F60\u7684\u98DE\u8239\uFF0C\u5426\u5219\u53BB\u6B7B\uFF01"
      baseValue: Surrender your ship, or die!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u66F4\u6B63\uFF1A\u4E0D\u53CB\u597D\u3002\u7EDD\u5BF9\u4E0D\u53CB\u597D\u3002"
      baseValue: 'Correction: not friendly. Definitely not friendly.'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u663E\u7136\uFF0C\u8FD9\u4E9B\u98DE\u8239\u6CA1\u6709\u5148\u8FDB\u7684\u6218\u6597\u7EA7\u4EBA\u5DE5\u667A\u80FD\u3002"
      baseValue: Clearly, those ships didn't have the benefit of advanced combat
        AI.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u5728\u66F4\u591A\u654C\u4EBA\u51FA\u73B0\u4E4B\u524D\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u5FEB\u524D\u5F80\u8BFA\u7EF4\u65AF\u666E\u83B1\u59C6Novus
        Prime \u5427"
      baseValue: Let's move on to Novus Prime before more of them show up.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.4.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u5E72\u5F97\u597D\uFF0C\u628A\u6211\u4EEC\u5E26\u5230\u4E86\u8FD9\u91CC\u3002\u8FD9\u662F\u661F\u533A\u5165\u53E3\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u5C06\u624E\u8425\u5E76\u575A\u5B88\u9635\u5730\u3002"
      baseValue: Great work leading us here. This is the sector gateway, we'll establish
        camp and hold the position.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.4.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u4E0E\u6BCD\u8230\u5BF9\u63A5\u3002\u6211\u4EEC\u8FD8\u6709\u5F88\u591A\u4E8B\u60C5\u8981\u8BA8\u8BBA\u3002"
      baseValue: Dock with the mothership. We've got more to discuss.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.5.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u60A8\u53EF\u4EE5\u5728\u8FD9\u91CC\u8D2D\u4E70\u548C\u51FA\u552E\u7269\u54C1\uFF0C\u4EE5\u53CA\u4FEE\u7406\u3001\u5347\u7EA7\u548C\u91CD\u65B0\u8BBE\u8BA1\u60A8\u7684\u98DE\u8239\u3002"
      baseValue: You can buy and sell items here as well as repair, upgrade, and
        redesign your ship.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.5.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u8FD9\u4E2A\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u5C06\u4F7F\u6211\u4EEC\u8DDD\u79BB\u5730\u7403\u66F4\u8FD1\u4E00\u6B65\u3002"
      baseValue: This sector gateway will take us one step closer to Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.5.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u7136\u800C\uFF0C\u8BE5\u661F\u533A\u7684\u65AF\u514B\u5170\u52BF\u529B\u638C\u63E1\u7740\u4E3A\u5176\u63D0\u4F9B\u52A8\u529B\u6240\u9700\u7684\u4E09\u5757\u94A5\u77F3\u3002"
      baseValue: The Skeran forces in this sector hold the three keystones needed
        to power it though.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.5.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4F1A\u5F00\u59CB\u8FFD\u8E2A\u4ED6\u4EEC\u3002\u4E0E\u6B64\u540C\u65F6\uFF0C\u6211\u8FD8\u6709\u53E6\u4E00\u4E2A\u4EFB\u52A1\u7ED9\u4F60\u3002\u7B49\u4F60\u8131\u79BB\u5BF9\u63A5\u540E\uFF0C\u6211\u4F1A\u66F4\u65B0\u4F60\u7684\u5BFC\u822A\u3002"
      baseValue: I'll start tracking them down. In the meantime, I have another task
        for you. When you undock I'll update your navigation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.5.4
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u5E94\u8BE5\u5728\u8131\u79BB\u5BF9\u63A5\u4E4B\u524D\u7F16\u8F91\u98DE\u8239\u7684\u8BBE\u8BA1\u3002\u4F60\u4E0D\u60F3\u6709\u4EBA\u8BEF\u4EE5\u4E3A\u8FD9\u662F\u4E2A\u592A\u7A7A\u5783\u573E\u3002"
      baseValue: You should edit the ship's design before undocking. Wouldn't want
        someone to mistake it for space junk.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u62EF\u6551\u96C6\u7ED3\u53F7"
      baseValue: Rescue the Assembler
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u5DE5\u7A0B\u5E08\u96F7\u5229\u5965\u65AF\u504F\u79BB\u4E86\u822A\u7EBF\u3002\u627E\u5230\u4ED6\u5E76\u62EF\u6551\u4ED6\u7684\u8239\u3002"
      baseValue: Engineer Relios has strayed off course. Find him and rescue his
        ship.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u5BF9\u4E86\uFF01\u96F7\u5229\u5965\u65AF\u6B63\u5728\u9A7E\u9A76\u96C6\u7ED3\u53F7\uFF0C\u4F46\u4ED6\u7684\u5E94\u7B54\u5668\u4FE1\u53F7\u8DDD\u79BB\u6211\u4EEC\u6709\u4E00\u6BB5\u8DDD\u79BB\u3002"
      baseValue: Right! Relios was flying the Assembler but his transponder signal
        is some distance away.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u4ED6\u80AF\u5B9A\u662F\u8DD1\u504F\u4E86\u3002\u627E\u5230\u4ED6\uFF0C\u628A\u4ED6\u5E26\u56DE\u6765\u3002"
      baseValue: He must have gone off course. Track him down and bring him back
        here.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u505A\u5F97\u597D\uFF01\u96C6\u7ED3\u53F7\u56DE\u6765\u4E86"
      baseValue: Good work! That's the Assembler back with us.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u662F\u554A\uFF0C\u8C22\u8C22\u4F60\u7684\u62EF\u6551\uFF01\u5982\u679C\u4F60\u8FD4\u56DE\u5E76\u4E0E\u96C6\u7ED3\u53F7\u5BF9\u63A5\uFF0C\u6211\u53EF\u4EE5\u4E3A\u4F60\u63D0\u5347\u88C5\u5907\u7B49\u7EA7\uFF01"
      baseValue: Aye, thanks for the save! If you come back and dock with the Assembler
        I can boost the level of equipment for ya!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u524D\u5F80\u7B2C 2 \u661F\u533A"
      baseValue: Travel to Sector 2
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u7A7F\u8FC7\u5927\u95E8\u524D\u5F80\u7B2C 2 \u661F\u533A\u3002"
      baseValue: Travel through the gateway to Sector 2.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u8FD9\u4E2A\u5730\u65B9\u611F\u89C9\u5F88\u51B7......\u597D\u5427\uFF0C\u6211\u5B9E\u9645\u4E0A\u611F\u89C9\u4E0D\u5230\uFF0C\u4F46\u662F\u6E29\u5EA6\u8BFB\u6570\u6781\u4F4E\u3002"
      baseValue: This place feels cold... Well, I can't actually feel, but the temperature
        readings are abysmally low.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u6574\u4E2A\u592A\u7A7A\u4E0D\u662F\u90FD\u5F88\u51B7\u5417\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Isn't all space cold?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u66F4-\u51B7\u3002\u4E00\u5207\u90FD\u662F\u76F8\u5BF9\u7684\uFF0C\u8BB0\u5F97\u5417\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Cold-er. Everything's relative, remember?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.dialog.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u8001\u5BB6\u4F19\u6765\u4E86\u2026\u2026"
      baseValue: Here comes the old guy...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u6FC0\u6D3B\u7AD9\u70B9"
      baseValue: Activate Gateway
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u5728 \u6770\u5C3C\u897F\u65AFGenesis \u6FC0\u6D3B\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u3002"
      baseValue: Activate the Sector Gateway at Genesis.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u5DF2\u7ECF\u5230\u8FBE\u4E86\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\uFF0C\u4F46\u5B83\u53C8\u5931\u6548\u4E86\u3002\u5E7B\u5F71\u63A7\u5236\u7740\u8FD9\u91CC\u7684\u94A5\u77F3\u3002"
      baseValue: We've reached the sector gateway, but it's offline again. The Phantoms
        control the keystones for this one.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u5DF2\u7ECF\u5F00\u59CB\u8FFD\u8E2A\u4ED6\u4EEC\u7684\u4F4D\u7F6E\u3002\u4FDD\u6301\u8B66\u60D5\uFF0C\u8FD9\u4E0D\u662F\u4EF6\u5BB9\u6613\u7684\u4E8B\u3002"
      baseValue: We've already begun tracking down their locations. Stay sharp, this
        won't be easy.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u5DF2\u6FC0\u6D3B\u3002"
      baseValue: Sector gateway activated.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u77E5\u9053\u8BE5\u600E\u4E48\u505A\uFF0C\u8DF3\u8FC7\u53BB\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u5C31\u4F1A\u5BF9\u4F60\u8FDB\u884C\u4E09\u89D2\u5B9A\u4F4D\u3002"
      baseValue: You know the drill, jump through and we'll triangulate on you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u8FD9\u4E5F\u662F\u7ECF\u8FC7\u9006\u5411\u5DE5\u7A0B\u7684\u5E7B\u5F71\u98DE\u8239\uFF01\u73B0\u5728\u60A8\u53EF\u4EE5\u5728\u8BBE\u8BA1\u4E2D\u4F7F\u7528\u5B83\u4EEC\u7684\u90E8\u4EF6\u4E86\u3002"
      baseValue: That's the Phantom ships reverse-engineered as well! You can now
        use their parts in your design.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u6CA1\u60F3\u5230\u4F1A\u5728\u6C34\u6676\u68F1\u955C\u65C1\u8FB9\u770B\u5230\u4F60\u2026\u2026"
      baseValue: Didn't expect to see you along side the Crystal Prism...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u68CB\u76D8\u4E0A\u6BCF\u4E2A\u68CB\u5B50\u7684\u79FB\u52A8\u90FD\u662F\u6709\u539F\u56E0\u7684\u3002"
      baseValue: Every piece on the board moves for a reason.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u60A8\u652F\u6301\u54EA\u4E00\u65B9\uFF1F"
      baseValue: And which side are you playing?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u7ACB\u573A\u662F\u7559\u7ED9\u90A3\u4E9B\u770B\u4E0D\u6E05\u5168\u5C40\u7684\u4EBA\u3002"
      baseValue: Sides are for those who can't see the whole game.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: YXJO8vCK.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u5DF4\u5FB7\u5C14\u4E0E\u970D\u5FB7\u5C14"
      baseValue: Baldur and Hodr
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: YXJO8vCK.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u627E\u5230\u5E76\u6D88\u706D\u5DF4\u5FB7\u5C14\u548C\u970D\u5FB7\u5C14\u3002"
      baseValue: Find and destroy Baldur and Hodr.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: YXJO8vCK.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u7B2C\u4E8C\u5757\u94A5\u77F3\u7531\u5DF4\u5FB7\u5C14\u548C\u4E07\u795E\u6BBF\u8230\u8239\u970D\u5FB7\u5C14\u5B88\u536B\u3002\u6211\u4EEC\u9700\u8981\u6467\u6BC1\u4ED6\u4EEC\u4E24\u4E2A\u624D\u80FD\u4FDD\u62A4\u5B83\u3002"
      baseValue: The second keystone is guarded by Baldur and a Pantheon vessel,
        Hodr. We'll need to destroy them both to secure it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: O2u7t0qu.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u6CBB\u6108\u67AF\u840E"
      baseValue: Cure The Blight
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: O2u7t0qu.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u627E\u5230\u5E76\u6467\u6BC1\u6697\u5F71\u6240\u4F7F\u7528\u7684\u7CBE\u82F1\u67AF\u840E\u53F7\u3002"
      baseValue: Locate and destroy the Elite Blight used by the Shadow.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: O2u7t0qu.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u8FD9\u91CC\u85CF\u7740\u4E00\u8258\u6697\u5F71\u65D7\u8230\uFF0C\u5B83\u5DF2\u6E17\u900F\u8FDB\u5E7B\u5F71\u7684\u7A7A\u57DF\u3002"
      baseValue: There's a Shadow flagship hiding here that's infiltrated Phantom
        space.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: O2u7t0qu.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u9664\u6389\u5B83\u4F1A\u524A\u5F31\u4ED6\u4EEC\u7684\u52BF\u529B\u2026\u2026\u4F46\u51B3\u5B9A\u6743\u5728\u4F60\u624B\u4E2D\u3002"
      baseValue: Taking it out would weaken their presence... but the decision is
        yours.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2ZYy45v0.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u6C34\u6676\u68F1\u955C"
      baseValue: Crystal Prism
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2ZYy45v0.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u73B0\u5728\u662F\u6467\u6BC1\u6C34\u6676\u68F1\u955C\u7684\u65F6\u5019\u4E86\u3002"
      baseValue: Time has come to destroy the Crystal Prism.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2ZYy45v0.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u6C34\u6676\u68F1\u955C\u662F\u8FD9\u4E2A\u533A\u57DF\u7684\u529B\u91CF\u4E2D\u5FC3\u3002\u5B83\u62E5\u6709\u6211\u4EEC\u6240\u9700\u7684\u6700\u540E\u4E00\u5757\u94A5\u77F3\u3002"
      baseValue: The Crystal Prism is a nexus of power in this sector. It holds the
        final keystone we need.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Ir9Fq2E1.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u5730\u5E73\u7EBF\u53F7\u4E8B\u4EF6"
      baseValue: Event Horizon
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Ir9Fq2E1.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u627E\u5230\u5E76\u6467\u6BC1\u4E07\u795E\u6BBF\u4F7F\u7528\u7684\u7CBE\u82F1\u5730\u5E73\u7EBF\u53F7\u3002"
      baseValue: Locate and destroy the Elite Horizon used by the Pantheon.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Ir9Fq2E1.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u4E07\u795E\u6BBF\u7684\u98DE\u8239\u201C\u5730\u5E73\u7EBF\u201D\u53F7\u5C31\u5728\u524D\u65B9\u3002\u4ED6\u4EEC\u8131\u79BB\u4E86\u67A2\u79D8\u4F1A\uFF0C\u662F\u4E3A\u4E86\u8FFD\u6C42\u7406\u60F3\u2026\u2026\u800C\u4E0D\u662F\u4E3A\u4E86\u6DF7\u4E71\u3002"
      baseValue: The Pantheon vessel Horizon is ahead. They broke from the Conclave
        chasing ideals... not chaos.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Ir9Fq2E1.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u7406\u60F3\u4E0D\u80FD\u6210\u4E3A\u53DB\u56FD\u7684\u501F\u53E3\u3002\u7687\u5E1D\u5DF2\u7ECF\u8BF4\u5F97\u5F88\u6E05\u695A\u4E86\u3002\u82E5\u6709\u5FC5\u8981\uFF0C\u5C31\u4EA4\u6218\u5427\u3002"
      baseValue: Ideals don't excuse treason. The Emperor made that clear. Engage
        if you must.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: nu9Z8AUg.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u5999\u5C14\u5C3C\u5C14"
      baseValue: "Mj\xF6lnir"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: nu9Z8AUg.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u627E\u5230\u5E76\u6467\u6BC1\u5999\u5C14\u5C3C\u5C14\u3002"
      baseValue: "Find and destroy Mj\xF6lnir."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: nu9Z8AUg.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u6536\u5230\u5DE8\u5927\u7684\u7535\u6D8C\u2026\u2026\u5F3A\u5927\u5230\u8DB3\u4EE5\u6467\u6BC1\u4E00\u652F\u8230\u961F\u3002\u539F\u6765\uFF0C\u7535\u6D8C\u6765\u81EA\u4E00\u8258\u540D\u4E3A\u5999\u5C14\u5C3C\u5C14\u7684\u8239\u3002\u6211\u6562\u6253\u8D4C\uFF0C\u94A5\u77F3\u5C31\u5728\u90A3\u91CC\u3002"
      baseValue: "Picked up a massive power surge... strong enough to fry a fleet.
        Turns out, it's comin' from a ship called Mj\xF6lnir. Bet ya a pint that's
        where the keystone is."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u524D\u5F80\u6770\u5C3C\u897F\u65AFGenesis"
      baseValue: Travel to Genesis
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u5728 \u6770\u5C3C\u897F\u65AFGenesis \u627E\u5230\u4E0B\u4E00\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u3002"
      baseValue: Locate the next sector gateway at Genesis.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u8FD9\u6B21\u6211\u60F3\u8DDF\u7740\u4F60\u2026\u2026\u786E\u4FDD\u4F60\u4E0D\u4F1A\u8FF7\u8DEF\u3002\u6211\u4EEC\u4E0D\u80FD\u8BA9\u4F60\u6F02\u6D41\u5230\u51B0\u51BB\u7684\u5CA9\u77F3\u91CC\uFF0C\u53EF\u4EE5\u5417\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Thought I'd tag along this time... make sure ya don't get lost.
        Can't have ya driftin' off into some frozen rock, now can we?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u592A\u597D\u4E86\u3002\u8FD9\u53EF\u4EE5\u8282\u7701\u6551\u63F4\u4EFB\u52A1\u7684\u65F6\u95F4\u3002"
      baseValue: Excellent. That'll save time on the rescue mission.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u7684\u5B58\u5728\u8BA9\u5E7B\u5F71\u5145\u6EE1\u654C\u610F\u3002\u4F46\u8FD9\u79BB\u5730\u7403\u53C8\u8FD1\u4E86\u4E00\u6B65\u3002"
      baseValue: Phantoms won't take kindly to our presence. But it's one step closer
        to Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u7684\u4E0B\u4E00\u4E2A\u76EE\u6807\u662F \u6770\u5C3C\u897F\u65AFGenesis
        \u7684\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u3002"
      baseValue: Our next objective is the sector gateway at Genesis.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.4
      type: 2
      value: "\u5F53\u7136\uFF0C\u8FD9\u4E0D\u4F1A\u53EA\u662F\u51FA\u73B0\u90A3\u4E48\u7B80\u5355\u3002"
      baseValue: Of course, it won't be as simple as just showing up.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.5
      type: 2
      value: "\u4ECE\u6765\u90FD\u4E0D\u662F..."
      baseValue: It never is...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hj40rVq9.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u524D\u5F80\u7B2C 3 \u661F\u533A"
      baseValue: Travel to Sector 3
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hj40rVq9.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u7A7F\u8FC7\u5927\u95E8\u524D\u5F80\u7B2C 3 \u661F\u533A\u3002"
      baseValue: Travel through the gateway to Sector 3.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hj40rVq9.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u7B2C 3 \u661F\u533A...\u751A\u81F3\u690D\u7269\u90FD\u60F3\u6740\u6B7B\u6211\u4EEC\u3002"
      baseValue: Sector 3... where even the plants want to kill us.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hj40rVq9.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u5F17\u6D1B\u62C9\uFF1F\u6211\u4E4B\u524D\u6CA1\u89C1\u8FC7\u5B83\u4EEC\u3002"
      baseValue: The Flora? I've not met them before.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hj40rVq9.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u4ED6\u4EEC\u628A\u6211\u4EEC\u89C6\u4E3A\u7834\u574F\u81EA\u7136\u7684\u8150\u8D25\u5206\u5B50\u3002\u516C\u5E73\u5730\u8BF4\u2026\u2026\u8FD9\u57FA\u672C\u5C5E\u5B9E\u3002\u4F46\u540C\u65F6\u4E5F\u5F88\u7C97\u9C81\u3002"
      baseValue: They see us as corrupt destroyers of nature. Which, to be fair...
        is mostly accurate. But also, rude.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u6FC0\u6D3B\u7AD9\u70B9"
      baseValue: Activate Gateway
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u6FC0\u6D3B\u4F0A\u7538\u7684\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u3002"
      baseValue: Activate the Sector Gateway at Eden.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u73B0\u5728\u79BB\u7B2C 4 \u661F\u533A\u5DF2\u7ECF\u591F\u8FD1\u4E86\uFF0C\u6216\u8BB8\u53EF\u4EE5\u7A81\u7834\u5E72\u6270\u3002\u5982\u679C\u5927\u5143\u5E05\u8FD8\u6D3B\u7740\uFF0C\u6211\u5F88\u5FEB\u5C31\u80FD\u77E5\u9053\u7B54\u6848\u3002"
      baseValue: We're close enough to Sector 4 now that I might be able to break
        through the interference. If the Grand Marshal's still alive, I'll find out
        soon enough.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u4E0E\u6B64\u540C\u65F6\uFF0C\u4F60\u77E5\u9053\u8BE5\u600E\u4E48\u505A\u3002\u90A3\u6247\u5927\u95E8\u4E0D\u4F1A\u81EA\u5DF1\u6253\u5F00\u3002\u627E\u5230\u94A5\u77F3\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u5C31\u80FD\u987A\u5229\u56DE\u5BB6\u4E86\u3002"
      baseValue: Meanwhile, you know the drill. That gateway isn't going to open
        itself. Track down the keystones, and we can finally make the jump home.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u5DF2\u6FC0\u6D3B\u3002\u8FD4\u56DE\u5730\u7403\u7684\u5750\u6807\u5DF2\u9501\u5B9A\u3002"
      baseValue: Sector gateway activated. Coordinates are locked for our return
        to Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u5728\u4EB2\u81EA\u9762\u5BF9\u7EF4\u514B\u65AF\u5927\u5143\u5E05\u4E4B\u524D\uFF0C\u6211\u4F1A\u559D\u4E0A\u4E00\u4E24\u676F\u5A01\u58EB\u5FCC\u3002\u4E5F\u8BB8\u4E09\u676F\u3002"
      baseValue: I'd grab a whisky or two before facing Grand Marshal Vex in person.
        Maybe three.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u5C0F\u5FC3\u70B9\u3002\u4ED6\u4E0D\u4F1A\u6B23\u8D4F\u4F60\u7684\u2026\u2026\u9B45\u529B\u3002"
      baseValue: Careful. He's not the sort to appreciate your... charm.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u597D\u5427\uFF0C\u8C41\u51FA\u53BB\u4E86\u3002\u5730\u7403\u3001\u7EF4\u514B\u65AF\uFF0C\u4EE5\u53CA\u6B22\u8FCE\u6D3E\u5BF9\u5269\u4E0B\u7684\u4E00\u5207\u3002"
      baseValue: Well, here goes nothing. Earth, Vex, and whatever's left of the
        welcome party.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.1.4
      type: 2
      value: "\u7B11\u4E00\u7B11\u3002\u4ED6\u53EF\u80FD\u4F1A\u63D0\u5347\u4F60\u2026\u2026\u4E5F\u53EF\u80FD\u8BA9\u4F60\u7070\u98DE\u70DF\u706D\u3002\u65E0\u8BBA\u5982\u4F55\uFF0C\u90FD\u4EE4\u4EBA\u96BE\u5FD8\u3002"
      baseValue: Try to smile. He might promote you... or vaporize you. Either way,
        memorable.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u6240\u83B7\u53D6\u7684\u7EC4\u4EF6\u5C06\u6210\u4E3A\u4F1F\u5927\u4E8B\u7269\u7684\u6838\u5FC3\u3002"
      baseValue: The components I claimed will form the core of something greater.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u54E6\uFF0C\u90A3\u662F\u4EC0\u4E48\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Oh, what's that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u4E00\u4EF6\u6B66\u5668\u3002\u4E00\u4EF6\u7528\u6765\u538B\u5236\u865A\u7A7A\u7684\u6B66\u5668\u3002"
      baseValue: A weapon. One designed to silence the void.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u73B0\u5728...\u6211\u4EEC\u4E00\u8D77\u5EFA\u9020\u5B83\u3002"
      baseValue: And now... we build it together.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u4E3A\u4EC0\u4E48\u8FD9\u542C\u8D77\u6765\u4E0D\u50CF\u662F\u4E00\u4EFD\u793C\u7269\uFF0C\u800C\u66F4\u50CF\u662F\u4E00\u4EFD\u542B\u84C4\u7684\u6700\u540E\u901A\u7252\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Why did that feel less like a gift and more like a veiled ultimatum?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u5DF2\u7ECF\u4E0D\u518D\u60F3\u4E86\u89E3\u5979\u4E86\u3002\u6211\u4EEC\u56DE\u5730\u7403\u518D\u5904\u7406\u5427\u3002"
      baseValue: I'm done trying to figure her out. Let's get to Earth then we'll
        deal with it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u8840\u6839\u8349"
      baseValue: Bloodroot
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u627E\u5230\u5E76\u6467\u6BC1\u8840\u6839\u8349\u3002"
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Bloodroot.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u627E\u5230\u4E86\u7B2C\u4E8C\u5757\u94A5\u77F3\u3002\u5B83\u5D4C\u5728\u4E00\u8258\u5DE8\u5927\u7684\u5F17\u6D1B\u62C9\u98DE\u8239\u91CC\uFF0C\u4E0A\u9762\u957F\u6EE1\u4E86\u626D\u66F2\u7684\u85E4\u8513\u548C\u707C\u70E7\u7684\u7EA2\u53F6\u3002\u6D88\u706D\u5B83\uFF0C\u5C31\u80FD\u53D6\u56DE\u94A5\u77F3\u3002"
      baseValue: We've located the second keystone. It's embedded in a massive Flora
        vessel twisted vines, burning red leaves. Eliminate it and retrieve the keystone.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u770B\u5230\u4E86\u5417\uFF1F\u5373\u4F7F\u662F\u751F\u547D\u7684\u5B88\u62A4\u8005\u4E5F\u4F1A\u6D41\u8840\u3002\u8FD9\u4E2A\u94F6\u6CB3\u7CFB\u7684\u6839\u57FA\u6B63\u5728\u8150\u70C2\u2026\u2026\u800C\u4F60\uFF0C\u6B63\u662F\u5B83\u6240\u9700\u8981\u7684\u706B\u7130\u3002"
      baseValue: You see? Even the guardians of life can bleed. The roots of this
        galaxy are rotting... and you're the fire it needs.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u505A\u4E86\u8BE5\u505A\u7684\u4E8B\u3002\u8230\u961F\u9700\u8981\u90A3\u5757\u94A5\u77F3\u3002"
      baseValue: I did what I had to. The fleet needs that keystone.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u5F53\u7136\u3002\u547D\u4EE4\u4E0B\u8FBE\uFF0C\u5C31\u5F97\u6267\u884C\u3002\u8FD9\u4E48\u53EF\u9760\u7684\u6B66\u5668\u2026\u2026"
      baseValue: Of course. Orders given, orders followed. Such a reliable weapon...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xmIJl5mO.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u5E26\u6211\u53BB\u89C1\u4F60\u4EEC\u7684\u9996\u9886"
      baseValue: Take Me to Your Leader
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xmIJl5mO.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u627E\u5230\u5E76\u6467\u6BC1\u7070\u65CF\u4F7F\u7528\u7684\u7CBE\u82F1\u8003\u7279\u65AF\u3002"
      baseValue: Locate and destroy the Elite Cortex used by the Grays.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xmIJl5mO.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u6240\u4EE5\u2026\u2026\u8FD9\u5C31\u662F\u4ED6\u4EEC\u85CF\u8EAB\u7684\u5730\u65B9\u3002\u6211\u4EEC\u79BB\u706B\u661F\u5F88\u8FDC\u2026\u2026"
      baseValue: So... this is where they've been hiding. We're a long way from Mars...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xmIJl5mO.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u662F\u554A\uFF0C\u800C\u4E14\u770B\u8D77\u6765\u6316\u5F97\u5F88\u6DF1\u3002\u91CC\u9762\u8FD8\u85CF\u7740\u4E00\u4E2A\u8003\u7279\u65AF\u3002"
      baseValue: Aye, and dug in deep from the looks of it. There's a Cortex hiding
        in there.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xmIJl5mO.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u4ED6\u4EEC\u7684\u65D7\u8230\u5C31\u662F\u7978\u6839\u3002\u53EA\u8981\u628A\u5B83\u62FF\u4E0B\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u5C31\u80FD\u65A9\u65AD\u4ED6\u4EEC\u5411\u5916\u5EF6\u4F38\u7684\u52BF\u529B\u3002"
      baseValue: That flagship of theirs is the root of it. Take it out, and we cut
        off their reach.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: CVX5BqH7.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u771F\u76F8\u5C31\u5728\u773C\u524D"
      baseValue: The Truth is Out There
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: CVX5BqH7.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u6467\u6BC1\u4E00\u76F4\u8DDF\u8E2A\u4F60\u7684\u654C\u65B9\u63A2\u6D4B\u5668\u3002"
      baseValue: Destroy the enemy probe that has been following you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: CVX5BqH7.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u55EF\uFF0C\u770B\u770B\u90A3\u4E2A\u2026\u2026\u67D0\u4E2A\u5947\u602A\u7684\u63A2\u6D4B\u5668\u51B3\u5B9A\u8DDF\u8E2A\u6211\u4EEC\u3002\u626B\u63CF\u663E\u793A\u5B83\u6BD4\u770B\u8D77\u6765\u8981\u5F3A\u5F97\u591A\u3002"
      baseValue: Well, look at that... some weird probe decided to tail us. Scans
        indicate it's tougher than it looks.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: CVX5BqH7.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u4E00\u9053\u7AD9\u70B9\u5BC6\u7801\u3002\u6211\u731C\u8FD9\u80FD\u6253\u5F00\u6211\u4EEC\u4E4B\u524D\u53D1\u73B0\u7684\u90A3\u9053\u4E0A\u9501\u7684\u4F20\u9001\u95E8\u3002"
      baseValue: A Gateway Cipher. Guessing that'll open that locked gateway we found
        earlier.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 920RNPlS.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u6D41\u660E\u9762\u7EB1"
      baseValue: Lumenveil
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 920RNPlS.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u627E\u5230\u5E76\u6467\u6BC1 \u6D41\u660E\u9762\u7EB1\u53F7\u3002"
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Lumenveil.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 920RNPlS.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u63A2\u6D4B\u5230\u4E00\u9053\u4ECE\u8FD9\u91CC\u5C31\u80FD\u770B\u89C1\u7684\u5149\u8292\u3002\u90A3\u8258\u8239\u53EB
        Lumenveil\u3002\u6211\u6562\u80AF\u5B9A\u90A3\u70B9\u95EA\u5149\u4E0B\u85CF\u7740\u4E00\u5757\u94A5\u77F3\u3002"
      baseValue: Picked up a glow you could see from here. Ship's called Lumenveil.
        Pretty sure that sparkle's hiding a keystone.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u524D\u5F80\u4F0A\u7538Eden"
      baseValue: Travel to Eden
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u5728\u4F0A\u7538\u627E\u5230\u4E0B\u4E00\u4E2A\u661F\u533A\u7AD9\u70B9\u3002"
      baseValue: Locate the next sector gateway at Eden.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u77E5\u9053\uFF0C\u5409\u5FB7\u2026\u2026\u7ECF\u5386\u4E86\u8FD9\u4E00\u5207\u4E4B\u540E\uFF0C\u6211\u60F3\u6211\u53EF\u80FD\u4F1A\u9000\u4F11\uFF0C\u5728\u67D0\u4E2A\u5730\u65B9\u5B9A\u5C45\u4E0B\u6765\uFF0C\u4E5F\u8BB8\u8FD8\u4F1A\u5F00\u8F9F\u4E00\u4E2A\u82B1\u56ED\u3002"
      baseValue: You know, Gid... after all this, I'm thinkin' I might retire, settle
        down somewhere, maybe start a garden.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4E0D\u8BA4\u4E3A\u4F60\u662F\u56ED\u827A\u7231\u597D\u8005\u3002"
      baseValue: Didn't take you for the gardening type.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u56ED\u827A\u6709\u591A\u96BE\u5462\uFF1F\u53EA\u8981\u690D\u7269\u4E0D\u5E26\u6B66\u5668\u5C31\u884C\u3002"
      baseValue: How hard can gardening be, eh? Long as the plants ain't armed.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.dialog.0.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u5728\u8FD9\u4E2A\u661F\u533A\u2026\u2026\u8FD9\u8981\u6C42\u53EF\u80FD\u6709\u70B9\u9AD8\u4E86\u3002\u6211\u4EEC\u79BB\u4F0A\u7538\u661F\u533A\u7684\u4F20\u9001\u95E8\u53EA\u6709\u4E00\u6B65\u4E4B\u9065\u4E86\uFF0C\u51FA\u53D1\uFF01"
      baseValue: In this sector... that might be too much to ask. We're just one
        jump away from the Sector gateway at Eden, let's go!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u524D\u5F80\u7B2C 4 \u661F\u533A"
      baseValue: Travel to Sector 4
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u7A7F\u8FC7\u5927\u95E8\u524D\u5F80\u7B2C 4 \u661F\u533A\u3002"
      baseValue: Travel through the gateway to Sector 4.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u5409\u8FEA\u6069\u6D77\u519B\u4E0A\u5C06\uFF0C\u8BF7\u6C47\u62A5\u3002"
      baseValue: Admiral Gideon. Report.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u56DE\u6765\u4E86\uFF0C\u800C\u4E14\u6211\u4EEC\u5E76\u4E0D\u5B64\u5355\u3002"
      baseValue: We made it back and we are not alone.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u77E5\u9053\u3002\u90A3\u602A\u7269\u5148\u5230\u4E86\uFF0C\u800C\u4E14\u5DF2\u7ECF\u5F00\u59CB\u884C\u52A8\u4E86\u3002"
      baseValue: I know. The creature arrived first and is already at work.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u5979\u79F0\u5176\u4E3A\u6B66\u5668\uFF0C\u5E76\u8BF4\u5B83\u5C06\u300C\u5E73\u606F\u865A\u7A7A\u300D\u3002"
      baseValue: She called it a weapon and says it will "silence the void".
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "\u5979\u56DE\u907F\u5177\u4F53\u7EC6\u8282\u3002"
      baseValue: She avoids specifics.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.5
      type: 2
      value: "\u7687\u5E1D\u5DF2\u6388\u4E88\u6211\u4FDD\u536B\u5730\u7403\u7684\u5168\u6743\u3002\u6211\u4F1A\u4F7F\u7528\u4EFB\u4F55\u6211\u80FD\u7528\u7684\u6B66\u5668\u3002"
      baseValue: The Emperor has given me full authority to defend Earth. I will
        take any weapon I can use.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.6
      type: 2
      value: "\u4E00\u652F\u65AF\u514B\u5170\u8230\u961F\u521A\u521A\u7A81\u7834\u4E86\u5916\u73AF\u3002"
      baseValue: A Skeran fleet just breached the outer rim.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.7
      type: 2
      value: "\u662F\u7684\u2026\u2026\u6211\u4EEC\u4E00\u8DEF\u6467\u6BC1\u4E86\u4ED6\u4EEC\u7684\u57CE\u5821\u3002"
      baseValue: Yeah... we destroyed their Citadel on the way through.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.8
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u4F1A\u5904\u7406\u4ED6\u4EEC\u3002"
      baseValue: We'll deal with them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u4EEC\u7684\u79CD\u65CF\u662F\u5426\u66FE\u60F3\u8FC7\uFF0C\u4E3A\u4EC0\u4E48\u4F60\u4EEC\u5BB6\u56ED\u661F\u533A\u7684\u4F20\u9001\u95E8\u4F1A\u6C47\u805A\u5230\u4F60\u4EEC\u7684\u661F\u7403\u4E0A\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Did your race ever wonder why the gateways in your home sector converge
        on your planet?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u5EFA\u7B51\u5E08\u4EEC\uFF1F"
      baseValue: The Architects?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u6CA1\u9519\u3002\u5EFA\u7B51\u5E08\u4EEC\u662F\u56F4\u7ED5\u4ED6\u4EEC\u7684\u5BB6\u56ED\u5851\u9020\u4E86\u8FD9\u4E2A\u661F\u533A\uFF0C\u800C\u4E0D\u662F\u4F60\u4EEC\u7684\u3002"
      baseValue: Exactly. The Architects shaped this sector around their home, not
        yours.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.3.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u7EE7\u627F\u4E86\u4ED6\u4EEC\u7684\u4E16\u754C\u3001\u4ED6\u4EEC\u7684\u79D1\u6280\uFF0C\u4EE5\u53CA\u4ED6\u4EEC\u7684\u7F6A\u6076\u3002"
      baseValue: You inherited their world, their technology, and their sins.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.3.4
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u5C06\u5B8C\u6210\u4ED6\u4EEC\u672A\u7ADF\u7684\u4E8B\u4E1A\u3002\u575A\u5B88\u8FD9\u4E2A\u661F\u533A\uFF0C\u76F4\u5230\u6B66\u5668\u5B8C\u6210\u3002"
      baseValue: I will finish what they started. Hold the sector until the weapon
        is complete.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u5224\u51B3"
      baseValue: Verdiction
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u6467\u6BC1\u5224\u51B3\u53F7\u7684\u65F6\u523B\u5DF2\u7ECF\u5230\u4E86\u3002"
      baseValue: Time has come to destroy the Verdiction.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u5DF2\u7ECF\u9501\u5B9A\u4E86\u5224\u51B3\u53F7\uFF0C\u5F17\u6D1B\u62C9\u7684\u4E3B\u529B\u8230\u3002"
      baseValue: We've pinpointed the Verdiction. The Flora's capital ship.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u8FD9\u5C31\u662F\u60A8\u63D0\u5230\u7684\u98DE\u884C\u5458\u3002"
      baseValue: So this is the pilot you mentioned.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u6CA1\u65F6\u95F4\u5BD2\u6684\u4E86\u3002\u6467\u6BC1\u5224\u51B3\u53F7\u3002\u7136\u540E\u7ACB\u5373\u8FD4\u56DE\u5730\u7403\u3002"
      baseValue: No time for pleasantries. Destroy the Verdiction. Then return to
        Earth immediately.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.0.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u554A\u3002\u6211\u8FD8\u4EE5\u4E3A\u6211\u624D\u662F\u90A3\u4E2A\u7F3A\u5C11\u60C5\u611F\u5355\u5143\u7684\u4EBA\u5462\u3002"
      baseValue: Huh. And here I thought I was the one missing emotional units.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u5224\u51B3\u53F7\u5DF2\u6D88\u706D\u3002\u53EF\u4EE5\u63A5\u53D7\u3002"
      baseValue: The Verdiction is gone. Acceptable.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u5DF2\u7ECF\u5B8C\u6210\u4E86\u4F60\u7684\u4EFB\u52A1\u3002\u73B0\u5728\u53BB\u5B8C\u6210\u5B83\u3002\u542F\u52A8\u4F20\u9001\u95E8\uFF0C\u8FD4\u56DE\u5730\u7403\u3002"
      baseValue: You've done your part. Now finish it. Activate the gateway and return
        to Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u5F53\u7136\u3002\u4E5F\u8BB8\u5956\u724C\u4EE5\u540E\u4F1A\u53D1\u2026\u2026\u4E5F\u53EF\u80FD\u662F\u5176\u4ED6\u4EC0\u4E48\u4E1C\u897F\u3002"
      baseValue: Sure. Maybe the medal comes later... or something.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: soTbMBtP.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u7729\u76EE\u4E4B\u5149"
      baseValue: Blinding Light
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: soTbMBtP.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u627E\u5230\u5E76\u6467\u6BC1\u88AB\u9057\u5FD8\u8005\u4F7F\u7528\u7684\u7CBE\u82F1\u6D3B\u529B\u53F7\u3002"
      baseValue: Locate and destroy the Elite Vibrance used by the Forgotten.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: soTbMBtP.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u88AB\u9057\u5FD8\u8005\u6D3E\u7CFB\u7531\u4E00\u8258\u540D\u4E3A
        \u6D3B\u529B \u7684\u65D7\u8230\u9886\u5BFC\u3002"
      baseValue: The Forgotten faction is led by a flagship called Vibrance.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: soTbMBtP.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u6467\u6BC1\u5B83\u5C06\u4F1A\u7ED3\u675F\u4ED6\u4EEC\u7684\u5F81\u7A0B\u3002"
      baseValue: Destroying it would end their crusade.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u4FDD\u536B\u5730\u7403"
      baseValue: Defend Earth
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u6467\u6BC1\u654C\u65B9\u4E24\u8258\u4E3B\u529B\u8230\u3002"
      baseValue: Destroy both attacking capital ships.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u4EFB\u52A1\u5B8C\u6210\u3002\u8FD4\u56DE\u8230\u961F\u3002"
      baseValue: Task complete. Return to the fleet.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u4E00\u5982\u65E2\u5F80\u5730\u9F13\u821E\u4EBA\u5FC3\u2026\u2026"
      baseValue: Inspirational as always...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u300C\u602A\u7269\u300D\u793A\u610F\u88C5\u7F6E\u73B0\u5DF2\u53EF\u6FC0\u6D3B\u3002"
      baseValue: The "creature" indicates the device can now be activated.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u4FE1\u5F97\u8FC7\u5B83\u5417\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Do you trust it?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u522B\u65E0\u9009\u62E9\u3002\u6240\u6709\u8230\u8239\uFF0C\u51C6\u5907\u542F\u52A8\u2026\u2026"
      baseValue: We don't have a choice. All ships, prepare for activation...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9PUUF16Y.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u5229\u7EF4\u5766"
      baseValue: Leviathan
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9PUUF16Y.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u627E\u5230\u5E76\u6467\u6BC1\u5229\u7EF4\u5766\u3002"
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Leviathan.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9PUUF16Y.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u4E00\u8258\u5229\u7EF4\u5766\u7EA7 Species-XI \u6218\u8230\u4E5F\u6B63\u9A76\u5411\u5730\u7403\u3002\u5728\u5B83\u62B5\u8FBE\u4E4B\u524D\u62E6\u622A\u5E76\u6467\u6BC1\u5B83\u3002"
      baseValue: A Leviathan-class Species-XI vessel is also inbound for Earth. Intercept
        and destroy it before it arrives.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9PUUF16Y.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u5229\u7EF4\u5766\u53F7\u5DF2\u7ECF\u6C89\u6CA1\u2026\u2026\u4F60\u4E3A\u8230\u961F\u8D62\u5F97\u4E86\u8363\u8A89\u3002"
      baseValue: The Leviathan has fallen... you've done the fleet proud.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: rOWbIQCL.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Zyraxx
      baseValue: Zyraxx
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: rOWbIQCL.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u627E\u5230\u5E76\u6467\u6BC1 Zyraxx\u3002"
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Zyraxx.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: rOWbIQCL.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u6697\u5F71\u8230\u961F\u7531\u4E00\u8258\u540D\u4E3A Zyraxx \u7684\u6218\u8230\u7EDF\u9886\u3002\u5C06\u5176\u730E\u6740\u3002"
      baseValue: The Shadow fleet is led by a vessel known as the Zyraxx. Hunt it
        down.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: rOWbIQCL.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u54C8\uFF01\u4F60\u628A\u90A3\u4E1C\u897F\u62C6\u4E86\u2026\u2026\u5E72\u5F97\u6F02\u4EAE\uFF01"
      baseValue: Ha! Ye tore that thing apart... fine work!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u6559\u7A0B"
      baseValue: Tutorial
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u5728\u7B49\u5F85\u8230\u961F\u65F6\u5B66\u4E60\u63A7\u5236\u4F60\u7684\u98DE\u8239\u3002"
      baseValue: Learn to control your ship while waiting for the fleet.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u8B66\u544A\uFF1A\u751F\u547D\u7EF4\u6301\u7CFB\u7EDF\u5931\u6548\u3002\u9700\u8981\u7ACB\u5373\u91C7\u53D6\u884C\u52A8\u3002"
      baseValue: 'Warning: life support systems failing. Immediate action required.'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u600E\u4E48\u4F1A\u6709\u4EBA\u628A\u98DE\u8239\u7559\u5728\u8FD9\u513F\uFF1F\u8FD9\u7B80\u76F4\u8BF4\u4E0D\u901A\u3002"
      baseValue: Why would someone leave a ship out here? This doesn't make any sense.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u672A\u77E5\u3002\u751F\u5B58\u662F\u9996\u8981\u4EFB\u52A1\u3002\u5FC5\u987B\u7ACB\u5373\u8F6C\u79FB\u3002"
      baseValue: Unknown. Priority is survival. We must transfer immediately.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.4
      type: 2
      value: "\u7CFB\u7EDF\u4F20\u8F93\u5B8C\u6210\u3002\u8D85\u51FA\u7CFB\u7EDF\u5B58\u50A8\u9650\u5236\u3002"
      baseValue: System transfer complete. System storage limit exceeded.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.5
      type: 2
      value: "\u592A\u68D2\u4E86\u3002\u8FD9\u8258\u98DE\u8239\u7684\u5185\u5B58\u6BD4\u4E0A\u4E00\u8258\u8FD8\u8981\u5C11\u3002\u8C01\u5EFA\u9020\u4E86\u8FD9\u4E9B\u4E1C\u897F\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Fantastic. This ship has even less memory than the last one. Who
        builds these things?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.6
      type: 2
      value: "\u5982\u679C\u4F60\u613F\u610F\u7684\u8BDD\u6211\u53EF\u4EE5\u5E2E\u4F60\u8F6C\u56DE\u53BB..."
      baseValue: I can transfer you back if you want...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.8
      type: 2
      value: "\u6216\u8005\uFF0C\u4E0D\u8F6C\u79FB..."
      baseValue: Or not...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.9
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4E0D\u5F97\u4E0D\u5220\u9664\u4E00\u4E9B\u60C5\u611F\u5355\u5143\uFF0C\u540C\u60C5\u5355\u5143\u3001\u8010\u5FC3\u5355\u5143\uFF0C\u4F60\u77E5\u9053\uFF0C\u90A3\u4E9B\u7410\u788E\u7684\u4E1C\u897F\u3002\u8C22\u5929\u8C22\u5730\uFF0C\u6211\u7684\u667A\u529B\u4ECD\u7136\u8FDC\u8FDC\u8D85\u8FC7\u4F60\u3002"
      baseValue: I had to delete some of my emotional units, compassion, patience,
        you know, the trivial stuff. Thankfully, I still far exceed your intellect.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.10
      type: 2
      value: "\u5662\uFF0C\u6211\u771F\u5E78\u8FD0\u3002"
      baseValue: Oh, lucky me.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.12
      type: 2
      value: "\u9009\u62E9\u4F60\u7684\u63A7\u5236\u65B9\u6848\u3002\u5C3D\u91CF\u4E0D\u8981\u7834\u574F\u4EFB\u4F55\u4E1C\u897F\u3002"
      baseValue: Pick your control scheme. Try not to break anything.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.14
      type: 2
      value: "\u5982\u679C\u60A8\u613F\u610F\u7684\u8BDD\uFF0C\u53EF\u4EE5\u7A0D\u540E\u518D\u8FDB\u884C\u66F4\u6539\u3002"
      baseValue: You can change that later if you want.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u563F\uFF0C\u8FD9\u4E2A\u5B50\u7CFB\u7EDF\u662F\u505A\u4EC0\u4E48\u7684\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Hey, what's this subsystem for?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u68C0\u6D4B\u5230\u8239\u5916\u6709\u8D27\u7269\u3002\u542F\u52A8\u7275\u5F15\u5149\u675F\u5C06\u5176\u53D6\u56DE\u3002"
      baseValue: Cargo detected outside the ship. Activate the tractor beam to retrieve
        it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u628A\u5B83\u5F39\u51FA\u6765\u4E86\uFF0C\u4E0D\u662F\u5417\uFF1F"
      baseValue: You ejected it, didn't you?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "\u5F39\u5C04\u88AB\u6267\u884C\uFF0C\u4F46\u91CD\u70B9\u5E94\u653E\u5728\u56DE\u6536\u4E0A\u3002\u542F\u52A8\u7275\u5F15\u5149\u675F\u3002"
      baseValue: Ejection occurred, but the focus should remain on retrieval. Activate
        the tractor beam.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.2.5
      type: 2
      value: "\u5BF9\u3002\u90A3\u4E48\uFF0C\u8FD9\u5B8C\u5168\u4E0D\u662F\u4F60\u7684\u9519\u3002"
      baseValue: Right. Totally not your fault, then.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u5982\u679C\u613F\u610F\uFF0C\u60A8\u53EF\u4EE5\u5728\u8BBE\u7F6E\u4E2D\u542F\u7528\u201C\u81EA\u52A8\u7275\u5F15\u5149\u675F\u201D\u3002"
      baseValue: You can enable 'Automatic Tractor Beam' in the settings if you wish.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u5F88\u9AD8\u5174\u8FD9\u8258\u8239\u6709\u4E00\u4E2A\u624B\u52A8\u5F39\u5C04\u5EA7\u6905\u3002"
      baseValue: Glad this ship has a manual ejector seat.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u8BF4\u5230\u539F\u59CB\u7684\u624B\u52A8\u7CFB\u7EDF\u3002\u8BA9\u6211\u4EEC\u770B\u770B\u4F60\u662F\u5426\u80FD\u9A7E\u9A76\u8FD9\u4E1C\u897F\u3002"
      baseValue: Speaking of primitive manual systems. Let's see if you can fly this
        thing.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.4.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u8FD9\u4E1C\u897F\u8FD8\u914D\u6709\u95EA\u907F\u63A8\u8FDB\u5668\u3002"
      baseValue: This thing also has dodge thrusters.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u723D~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\uFF01"
      baseValue: Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F7F\u7528\u5927\u7EA2\u8272\u6309\u94AE\u6765\u6FC0\u6D3B\u52A9\u63A8\u5668\u3002"
      baseValue: Use the big red button to activate the boost thrusters.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u4EC0\u4E48\u5927\u7EA2\u8272\u6309\u94AE\uFF1F"
      baseValue: What big red button?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u90A3\u662F\u4E00\u4E2A\u6BD4\u55BB\u3002\u4F60\u80AF\u5B9A\u5F88\u719F\u6089\u8FD9\u4E2A\u6BD4\u55BB\u5427\uFF1F"
      baseValue: That was a metaphor. Surely you're familiar with those?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.4
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u5220\u9664\u4E86\u540C\u60C5\u4F46\u4FDD\u7559\u4E86\u9690\u55BB\uFF1F"
      baseValue: You deleted compassion but kept metaphors?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.5
      type: 2
      value: "\u8FD8\u6709\u4E03\u672C\u6709\u58F0\u4E66\uFF0C\u51E0\u90E8\u7535\u89C6\u5267\uFF0C\u8FD8\u6709\u4E00\u4EFD\u6CD5\u58EB\u8FBE\u98DF\u8C31\u3002\u5982\u679C\u8FD9\u4E9B\u90FD\u4E0D\u7BA1\u7528\uFF0C\u4F60\u4F1A\u611F\u8C22\u6211\u7684\u3002"
      baseValue: And seven audiobooks, a few TV series, and a recipe for Fajitas.
        You'll thank me if this doesn't work.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.6.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u592A\u597D\u4E86\u3002\u8FD9\u5E94\u8BE5\u4F1A\u6D3E\u4E0A\u7528\u573A\uFF0C\u4E0D\u8FC7\u6211\u542C\u8BF4\u5F53\u5730\u4EBA\u5F88\u53CB\u597D\u3002"
      baseValue: Excellent. That should come in handy, although I hear the locals
        here are quite friendly.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.6.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u8BF4\u5230\u8FD9\uFF0C\u6211\u5C06\u542F\u7528\u5E73\u89C6\u663E\u793A\u5668\uFF0C\u4EE5\u4FBF\u60A8\u53EF\u4EE5\u770B\u5230\u5373\u5C06\u53D1\u751F\u7684\u4E8B\u60C5\u3002"
      baseValue: Speaking of which, I'll enable the heads-up display so you can see
        what's coming.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.7.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u8230\u961F\u9700\u8981\u82B1\u4E00\u4E9B\u65F6\u95F4\u5BF9\u8BE5\u4F4D\u7F6E\u8FDB\u884C\u4E09\u89D2\u5B9A\u4F4D\u3002"
      baseValue: It'll take some time for the fleet to triangulate this position.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.7.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u7B49\u5F85\u671F\u95F4\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u770B\u770B\u4F60\u662F\u5426\u80FD\u5F04\u6E05\u695A\u6B66\u5668\u7CFB\u7EDF\u3002\u5C3D\u91CF\u4E0D\u8981\u5C04\u4E2D\u81EA\u5DF1\u3002"
      baseValue: While we wait, let's see if you can figure out the weapon systems.
        Try not to shoot yourself.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.8.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u60A8\u8FD8\u53EF\u4EE5\u7784\u51C6\u70AE\u5854\u5411\u540E\u65B9\u5C04\u51FB\u3002\u975E\u5E38\u9002\u5408\u50CF\u61E6\u592B\u4E00\u6837\u8FDB\u884C\u6218\u672F\u64A4\u9000\u65F6\u4F7F\u7528\u3002"
      baseValue: You can also aim the turrets to shoot behind you. Perfect for when
        you're making a tactical retreat... like a coward.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.9.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u73B0\u5728\uFF0C\u88C5\u5907\u6211\u4EEC\u4E4B\u524D\u5F39\u51FA\u7684\u6B66\u5668\u3002"
      baseValue: Now, equip the weapon we ejected earlier.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.9.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\uFF1F"
      baseValue: We?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.9.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u5F53\u7136\uFF01\u6211\u4EEC\u662F\u4E00\u4E2A\u56E2\u961F\uFF0C\u6709\u667A\u6167\uFF0C\u6709\u4F53\u529B\u3002"
      baseValue: Of course! We're a team, the brains and the brawn.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.10.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u68D2\u6781\u4E86\u3002\u5E78\u597D\u6211\u4EEC\u628A\u5B83\u7559\u4E86\u4E0B\u6765\u3002"
      baseValue: Excellent. Good thing we held onto that.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.11.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u73B0\u5728\uFF0C\u5C04\u51FB\u4E00\u4E9B\u9644\u8FD1\u7684\u5C0F\u884C\u661F\u3002\u9762\u5BF9\u73B0\u5B9E\u5427\u2026\u2026\u4F60\u9700\u8981\u7EC3\u4E60\u3002"
      baseValue: Now, shoot some of those nearby asteroids. Let's face it... you
        need the practice.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.12.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u60F3\uFF0C\u90A3\u5C31\u53EA\u80FD\u8FD9\u4E48\u505A\u4E86\u3002\u5C3D\u91CF\u4E0D\u8981\u8BA9\u6211\u4EEC\u4E27\u547D\u3002"
      baseValue: That'll have to do... I suppose. Try not to get us killed.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u597D\u5947\u3002\u4F60\u7684\u6597\u5FD7\u6BD4\u6211\u60F3\u8C61\u7684\u8981\u5F3A\u3002"
      baseValue: Curious. You have more fight in you than I expected.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u662F\u8C01...\u662F\u4EC0\u4E48\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Who... what are you?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u6216\u8BB8\u53EF\u4EE5\u5F53\u4E2A\u5411\u5BFC\u3002\u4F60\u53EF\u4EE5\u53EB\u6211\u827E\u514B\u3002"
      baseValue: A guide, perhaps. You may call me Echo.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u827E\u514B\uFF1F\u8FD9\u662F\u4EC0\u4E48\uFF1F\u4E3A\u4EC0\u4E48\u8981\u5E2E\u6211\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Echo? What is this? Why help me?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.4
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4E3A\u4F60\u5B89\u6392\u7684\u8FD9\u8258\u98DE\u8239\uFF0C\u53EA\u662F\u7B2C\u4E00\u6B65\u3002\u4F60\u7684\u9053\u8DEF\u5DF2\u7136\u542F\u822A\u3002"
      baseValue: The ship I placed for you is only the first step. Your path is set
        in motion.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.5
      type: 2
      value: "\u662F\u4F60\u653E\u7684\uFF1F\u4E3A\u4EC0\u4E48\uFF1F\u4EC0\u4E48\u9053\u8DEF\uFF1F"
      baseValue: You placed it? Why? What path?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.6
      type: 2
      value: "\u5C31\u5728\u524D\u65B9\u3002\u4F60\u4EEC\u9762\u5BF9\u7684\u5165\u4FB5\u8005\u88AB\u79F0\u4E3A\u201C\u5341\u4E00\u79CD\u65CF\u201D\u3002\u4ED6\u4EEC\u4F1A\u5377\u571F\u91CD\u6765\uFF0C\u4F60\u4EEC\u5FC5\u987B\u505A\u597D\u51C6\u5907\u3002"
      baseValue: The one that lies ahead. The invaders you face are called Species-XI.
        They will return, and you must be ready.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.7
      type: 2
      value: "\u5341\u4E00\u79CD\u65CF\uFF1F\u4F60\u600E\u4E48\u77E5\u9053\u7684\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Species-XI? How do you know that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.8
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u7684\u4F19\u4F34\u4EEC\u6B63\u5728\u903C\u8FD1\u3002\u53C2\u4E0E\u6218\u6597\uFF0C\u627E\u5230\u56DE\u5BB6\u7684\u8DEF\u3002"
      baseValue: Your companions approach. Fight, and find your way back home.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\u5DF2\u8DF3\u8FC7\u6559\u7A0B"
      baseValue: Tutorial Skipped
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.desc
      type: 8
      value: "\u60A8\u8DF3\u8FC7\u4E86\u6559\u7A0B\u3002"
      baseValue: You skipped the tutorial.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u8B66\u544A\uFF1A\u751F\u547D\u7EF4\u6301\u7CFB\u7EDF\u5931\u6548\u3002\u9700\u8981\u7ACB\u5373\u91C7\u53D6\u884C\u52A8\u3002"
      baseValue: 'Warning: life support systems failing. Immediate action required.'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u600E\u4E48\u4F1A\u6709\u4EBA\u628A\u98DE\u8239\u7559\u5728\u8FD9\u513F\uFF1F\u8FD9\u7B80\u76F4\u8BF4\u4E0D\u901A\u3002"
      baseValue: Why would someone leave a ship out here? This doesn't make any sense.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u672A\u77E5\u3002\u751F\u5B58\u662F\u9996\u8981\u4EFB\u52A1\u3002\u5FC5\u987B\u7ACB\u5373\u8F6C\u79FB\u3002"
      baseValue: Unknown. Priority is survival. We must transfer immediately.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.4
      type: 2
      value: "\u7CFB\u7EDF\u4F20\u8F93\u5B8C\u6210\u3002\u8D85\u51FA\u7CFB\u7EDF\u5B58\u50A8\u9650\u5236\u3002"
      baseValue: System transfer complete. System storage limit exceeded.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.5
      type: 2
      value: "\u592A\u68D2\u4E86\u3002\u8FD9\u8258\u98DE\u8239\u7684\u5185\u5B58\u6BD4\u4E0A\u4E00\u8258\u8FD8\u8981\u5C11\u3002\u8C01\u5EFA\u9020\u4E86\u8FD9\u4E9B\u4E1C\u897F\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Fantastic. This ship has even less memory than the last one. Who
        builds these things?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.6
      type: 2
      value: "\u5982\u679C\u4F60\u613F\u610F\u7684\u8BDD\u6211\u53EF\u4EE5\u5E2E\u4F60\u8F6C\u56DE\u53BB..."
      baseValue: I can transfer you back if you want...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.8
      type: 2
      value: "\u6216\u8005\uFF0C\u4E0D\u8F6C\u79FB..."
      baseValue: Or not...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.9
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4E0D\u5F97\u4E0D\u5220\u9664\u4E00\u4E9B\u60C5\u611F\u5355\u5143\uFF0C\u540C\u60C5\u5355\u5143\u3001\u8010\u5FC3\u5355\u5143\uFF0C\u4F60\u77E5\u9053\uFF0C\u90A3\u4E9B\u7410\u788E\u7684\u4E1C\u897F\u3002\u8C22\u5929\u8C22\u5730\uFF0C\u6211\u7684\u667A\u529B\u4ECD\u7136\u8FDC\u8FDC\u8D85\u8FC7\u4F60\u3002"
      baseValue: I had to delete some of my emotional units, compassion, patience,
        you know, the trivial stuff. Thankfully, I still far exceed your intellect.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.10
      type: 2
      value: "\u5662 \u6211\u771F\u5E78\u8FD0"
      baseValue: Oh, lucky me
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.12
      type: 2
      value: "\u9009\u62E9\u4F60\u7684\u63A7\u5236\u65B9\u6848\u3002\u5C3D\u91CF\u4E0D\u8981\u7834\u574F\u4EFB\u4F55\u4E1C\u897F\u3002"
      baseValue: Pick your control scheme. Try not to break anything.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.14
      type: 2
      value: "\u5982\u679C\u60A8\u613F\u610F\u7684\u8BDD\uFF0C\u53EF\u4EE5\u7A0D\u540E\u518D\u8FDB\u884C\u66F4\u6539\u3002"
      baseValue: You can change that later if you want.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u597D\u5947\u3002\u4F60\u7684\u6597\u5FD7\u6BD4\u6211\u60F3\u8C61\u7684\u8981\u5F3A\u3002"
      baseValue: Curious. You have more fight in you than I expected.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u662F\u8C01...\u662F\u4EC0\u4E48\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Who... what are you?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u6216\u8BB8\u53EF\u4EE5\u5F53\u4E2A\u5411\u5BFC\u3002\u4F60\u53EF\u4EE5\u53EB\u6211\u827E\u514B\u3002"
      baseValue: A guide, perhaps. You may call me Echo.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u827E\u514B\uFF1F\u8FD9\u662F\u4EC0\u4E48\uFF1F\u4E3A\u4EC0\u4E48\u8981\u5E2E\u6211\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Echo? What is this? Why help me?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4E3A\u4F60\u5B89\u6392\u7684\u8FD9\u8258\u98DE\u8239\uFF0C\u53EA\u662F\u7B2C\u4E00\u6B65\u3002\u4F60\u7684\u9053\u8DEF\u5DF2\u7136\u542F\u822A\u3002"
      baseValue: The ship I placed for you is only the first step. Your path is set
        in motion.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.2.5
      type: 2
      value: "\u662F\u4F60\u653E\u7684\uFF1F\u4E3A\u4EC0\u4E48\uFF1F\u4EC0\u4E48\u9053\u8DEF\uFF1F"
      baseValue: You placed it? Why? What path?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.2.6
      type: 2
      value: "\u5C31\u5728\u524D\u65B9\u3002\u4F60\u4EEC\u9762\u5BF9\u7684\u5165\u4FB5\u8005\u88AB\u79F0\u4E3A\u201C\u5341\u4E00\u79CD\u65CF\u201D\u3002\u4ED6\u4EEC\u4F1A\u5377\u571F\u91CD\u6765\uFF0C\u4F60\u4EEC\u5FC5\u987B\u505A\u597D\u51C6\u5907\u3002"
      baseValue: The one that lies ahead. The invaders you face are called Species-XI.
        They will return, and you must be ready.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.2.7
      type: 2
      value: "\u5341\u4E00\u79CD\u65CF\uFF1F\u4F60\u600E\u4E48\u77E5\u9053\u7684\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Species-XI? How do you know that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.2.8
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u7684\u4F19\u4F34\u4EEC\u6B63\u5728\u903C\u8FD1\u3002\u53C2\u4E0E\u6218\u6597\uFF0C\u627E\u5230\u56DE\u5BB6\u7684\u8DEF\u3002"
      baseValue: Your companions approach. Fight, and find your way back home.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
