      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u5373\u4F7F\u662F\u6781\u529B\u4FDD\u62A4\u81EA\u7136\u7684\u5F17\u6D1B\u62C9\uFF0C\u4E5F\u7D27\u7D27\u6293\u4F4F\u90A3\u4E9B\u5B83\u4EEC\u51E0\u4E4E\u65E0\u6CD5\u7406\u89E3\u7684\u9057\u8FF9\u4E0D\u653E\u3002"
      baseValue: Even the Flora, so desperate to preserve nature, clung to relics
        they barely comprehended.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u53C8\u83B7\u53D6\u4E86\u4E00\u4EF6...\u6BCF\u591A\u4E00\u4EF6\uFF0C\u8BBE\u8BA1\u5C31\u53D8\u5F97\u66F4\u52A0\u6E05\u6670\u3002"
      baseValue: Another piece claimed... the design grows clearer with each one.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.name
      type: 5
      value: "\u5999\u5C14\u5C3C\u5C14"
      baseValue: "Mj\xF6lnir"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u53C8\u662F\u4F60\u2026\u2026\u4F60\u6536\u96C6\u8FD9\u4E9B\u90E8\u4EF6\u5E72\u4EC0\u4E48\uFF1F"
      baseValue: You again... What are you collecting these parts for?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u8FD9\u4E0D\u662F\u5E7B\u5F71\u79D1\u6280\u3002\u5B83\u662F\u7531\u90A3\u4E9B\u5728\u661F\u9645\u95F4\u64AD\u6492\u751F\u547D\u79CD\u5B50\u7684\u5EFA\u7B51\u5E08\u4EEC\u6253\u9020\u7684\u3002"
      baseValue: This isn't Phantom technology. It was crafted by the Architects...
        the ones who seeded life across the stars.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u5728\u4ED6\u4EEC\u5931\u53BB\u610F\u4E49\u4E4B\u524D\u2026\u2026\u5E76\u6D88\u5931\u5728\u4ED6\u4EEC\u81EA\u5DF1\u7684\u5149\u8292\u4E2D\u3002"
      baseValue: Before they lost their purpose... and vanished into their own light.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u662F\u4E3A\u4E86\u66F4\u5D07\u9AD8\u7684\u76EE\u6807\u800C\u83B7\u53D6\u5B83\u7684\u3002\u5230\u65F6\u5019\u4F60\u5C31\u4F1A\u660E\u767D\u3002"
      baseValue: I'm claiming it for a higher purpose. When the time comes you will
        see.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
