      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u89C9\u5F97\u90A3\u662F\u4E00\u4E2A\u6BD4\u55BB\u3002\u4F60\u660E\u767D\u4E86\u5417\uFF1F"
      baseValue: I think that was a metaphor. I thought you understood those?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u54E6\uFF0C\u5BF9\u4E86\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u5C31\u662F\u6C61\u67D3\u6E90\u2026\u2026\u660E\u767D\u4E86\uFF01"
      baseValue: Oh right, we're the pollution... got it!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
