      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u70E7\u6B7B\u4E86\u6211\u4EEC\u7684\u8239\u5458\u3002\u6211\u4EEC\u6765\u62A5\u590D\u2026\u2026\u800C\u4E14\u4F1A\u8FDE\u672C\u5E26\u5229\u3002"
      baseValue: You torched our crew. We're here to return the favor... with interest.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u53C8\u662F\u8FD9\u4E9B\u7B28\u86CB\uFF01\u4ED6\u4EEC\u4F1A\u91CD\u751F\u5417\uFF1F\u8FD8\u662F\u53EA\u662F\u7E41\u6B96\uFF1F"
      baseValue: Not these meatheads again. Do they respawn, or just multiply?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u8D70\u8FC7\u6628\u5929\u2026\u2026\u53C8\u4ECE\u660E\u5929\u56DE\u6765\u3002"
      baseValue: I have walked through yesterday... and returned from tomorrow.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u592A\u68D2\u4E86\u3002\u6709\u4E0A\u5E1D\u60C5\u7ED3\u7684\u65F6\u7A7A\u763E\u541B\u5B50\u3002"
      baseValue: Fantastic. Temporal junkies with a god complex.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u4ED6\u4EEC\u5230\u5E95\u5728\u8FFD\u6C42\u4EC0\u4E48\uFF1F"
      baseValue: What are they even after?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u8D85\u8D8A\u2026\u2026\u6216\u8005\u4E5F\u8BB8\u662F\u65F6\u95F4\u5C3D\u5934\u7684\u4E00\u6B21\u96C6\u4F53\u51A5\u60F3\u3002"
      baseValue: Transcendence... or maybe a group meditation session at the end
        of time.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u88AB\u56F0\u5728\u4E86\u73B0\u5728\u2026\u2026\u800C\u672A\u6765\u4E0D\u518D\u9700\u8981\u4F60\u3002"
      baseValue: You are trapped in the present... and the future no longer wants
        you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u8FD9\u662F\u65F6\u95F4\u6F02\u79FB\u8005\u5728\u8BF4\u8BDD\u3002\u4ED6\u4EEC\u7684\u8111\u5B50\u6DF7\u4E71\u3002"
      baseValue: That's the Temporal Drift talking. Their minds are scrambled.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u542C\u5230\u4F60\u4E86\uFF0C\u6EF4\u7B54\u4F5C\u54CD\u7684\u5E7D\u7075\uFF01\u4F60\u7684\u7EBF\u6027\u601D\u7EF4\u66B4\u9732\u4E86\u4F60\u7684\u5F31\u70B9\uFF01"
      baseValue: We hear you, ticking ghost! Your linear thoughts betray your weakness!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u7B49\u7B49\u2026\u2026\u4ED6\u4EEC\u80FD\u542C\u5230\u6211\u8BF4\u8BDD\u5417\uFF1F\u8FD9\u53EF\u4E0D\u662F\u6B63\u5E38\u73B0\u8C61\u3002"
      baseValue: Wait... they can hear me? That's not how this is supposed to work.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "\u6211\u4EEC\u5DF2\u7ECF\u8D85\u8D8A\u4E86\u4F60\u7684\u65F6\u95F4\u3002\u4F60\u65E0\u6CD5\u6355\u6349\u5DF2\u7ECF\u53D1\u751F\u7684\u4E8B\u3002"
      baseValue: We've stepped outside your time. You can't catch what's already
        happened.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u5728\u5149\u7EBF\u65E0\u6CD5\u5230\u8FBE\u7684\u5730\u65B9\u5F98\u5F8A\u2026\u2026\u5E76\u4E14\u770B\u4E0D\u5230\u63A5\u4E0B\u6765\u4F1A\u53D1\u751F\u4EC0\u4E48\u3002"
      baseValue: You wander where the light does not reach... and do not see what
        follows.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u795E\u79D8\u800C\u53C8\u4EE4\u4EBA\u4E0D\u5B89\u3002\u6B63\u5982\u6211\u6240\u6599\u3002"
