      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u5BF9\u8C61\u4ECD\u672A\u670D\u4ECE\u3002\u7EE7\u7EED\u8FDB\u884C\u4E8C\u7EA7\u5904\u7F6E\u534F\u8BAE\u3002"
      baseValue: Subject remains noncompliant. Proceeding with secondary containment
        protocol.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\u4F60\u4E0D\u4F1A\u662F\u771F\u7684\u8FD8\u60F3\u7ED1\u67B6\u6211\u5427\uFF1F"
      baseValue: You're not seriously still trying to abduct me?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u662F\u7684\u3002\u800C\u4E14\u4ECE\u626B\u63CF\u5CF0\u503C\u6765\u770B\u2026\u2026\u4ED6\u4EEC\u5E26\u4E86\u4E00\u4E2A\u66F4\u5927\u7684\u7F50\u5B50\u3002"
      baseValue: They are. And judging by the scanner spike... they brought a bigger
        jar.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.3
